WEBVTT

02:06.036 --> 02:07.292
We're not clear yet.

02:07.316 --> 02:09.784
There are still 30 pallets
of cannon shells in C bunker.

02:09.956 --> 02:11.868
Forget the munitions,
there's no time.

02:11.898 --> 02:13.710
Just get everyone
on the transports.

02:13.796 --> 02:16.026
Oh, no.

02:28.036 --> 02:30.231
We've caught them in the
middle of their evacuation.

02:31.156 --> 02:34.592
I have my orders from
Supreme Leader Snoke himself.

02:34.796 --> 02:38.425
This is where we snuff out
the Resistance once and for all.

02:38.996 --> 02:41.635
Tell Captain Canady
to prime his dreadnought.

02:41.796 --> 02:47.314
Incinerate their base, destroy their
transports and obliterate their fleet.

03:02.276 --> 03:05.712
General, Resistance ship approaching.
Guns and shields in attack mode.

03:06.756 --> 03:09.145
A single light fighter.

03:18.596 --> 03:20.985
Happy beeps here, buddy, come on.

03:21.156 --> 03:22.372
We've pulled crazier stunts than this.

03:22.396 --> 03:24.432
Just for the record,
Commander Dameron,

03:24.636 --> 03:26.069
I'm with the droid on this one.

03:26.236 --> 03:28.113
Thank you for your support, General.

03:29.276 --> 03:30.425
Happy beeps.

03:31.596 --> 03:32.596
Attention.

03:32.676 --> 03:34.612
This is Commander Poe Dameron
of the Republic fleet,

03:34.636 --> 03:37.628
I have an urgent
communiqué for General Hugs.

03:37.796 --> 03:39.149
Patch him through.

03:39.476 --> 03:41.990
This is General Hux
of the First Order.

03:42.476 --> 03:44.467
The Republic is no more.

03:44.636 --> 03:47.867
Your fleet are Rebel scum
and war criminals.

03:48.076 --> 03:50.510
Tell your precious princess
there will be no terms,

03:50.676 --> 03:53.190
there will be no surrender.

03:54.476 --> 03:56.387
Hi, I'm holding for General Hugs.

03:56.556 --> 03:59.514
This is Hux.
You and your friends are doomed.

03:59.716 --> 04:02.753
We will wipe your filth
from the galaxy.

04:03.676 --> 04:05.712
Okay. I'll hold.

04:06.396 --> 04:07.396
Hello?

04:07.756 --> 04:10.270
Hello? Yup.
I'm still here.

04:11.036 --> 04:12.754
Can he hear me?

04:12.916 --> 04:14.144
- Hugs?
- He can.

04:14.316 --> 04:17.547
With an "H." Skinny guy.
Kinda pasty.

04:17.996 --> 04:21.033
I can hear you.
Can you hear me?

04:21.236 --> 04:22.996
Look, I can't hold forever.
If you reach him,

04:23.196 --> 04:26.108
tell him Leia has
an urgent message for him...

04:26.276 --> 04:28.551
I believe he's tooling with you, sir.

04:28.716 --> 04:30.468
...about his mother.

04:30.836 --> 04:32.349
Open fire!

04:32.436 --> 04:34.052
BB-8, punch it!

04:43.876 --> 04:45.275
He's going for the dreadnought.

04:45.356 --> 04:46.356
Ha!

04:46.956 --> 04:48.071
He's insane.

04:50.316 --> 04:52.193
Woo-hoo! That's got a kick.

05:06.476 --> 05:08.353
All right, taking out the cannons now.

05:08.436 --> 05:09.556
Tallie, start your approach.

05:09.596 --> 05:10.756
Copy that.

05:12.236 --> 05:15.194
Captain Canady,
why aren't you blasting that puny ship?

05:15.596 --> 05:18.156
That puny ship is too small
and at too close range.

05:18.316 --> 05:19.669
We need to scramble our fighters

05:20.156 --> 05:21.874
five bloody minutes ago.

05:22.036 --> 05:23.316
He'll never penetrate our armor.

05:23.396 --> 05:25.193
He's not trying to penetrate our armor.

05:25.396 --> 05:27.352
He's clearing out our surface cannons.

05:29.716 --> 05:30.944
One cannon left.

05:31.116 --> 05:32.435
And here comes the parade.

05:38.076 --> 05:39.076
Yeah! Yeah, I see him!

05:43.996 --> 05:46.385
No, no, no.
Damn it!

05:46.476 --> 05:47.836
BB-8, my weapons systems are down.

05:47.956 --> 05:49.252
We gotta take out that last cannon

05:49.276 --> 05:50.345
or our bombers are toast.

05:50.516 --> 05:51.835
Work your magic, buddy.

06:07.396 --> 06:08.909
Are the auto-cannons primed?

06:09.076 --> 06:10.076
Primed and ready, sir.

06:10.236 --> 06:11.430
What are we waiting for?

06:11.836 --> 06:12.871
Fire on the base!

06:17.476 --> 06:18.476
Punch it!

06:26.836 --> 06:29.236
The last transport is in the air.
The evacuation is complete.

06:29.956 --> 06:31.184
You did it, Poe.

06:31.396 --> 06:34.593
Now get your squad back here
so we can get out of this place.

06:34.676 --> 06:35.745
No, General...

06:35.836 --> 06:37.394
We can do this.
We have the chance

06:37.556 --> 06:38.625
to take out a dreadnought.

06:42.676 --> 06:44.268
These things are fleet killers.

06:44.436 --> 06:45.476
We can't let it get away.

06:45.516 --> 06:46.710
Disengage now...

06:46.876 --> 06:49.674
Commander.
That is an or...

06:55.436 --> 06:58.587
Wipe that nervous expression
off your face, Threepio.

06:59.116 --> 07:01.789
Oh. Well,
I will certainly try, General.

07:01.956 --> 07:03.105
Nervous?

07:05.916 --> 07:07.269
Let's go, BB-8.

07:07.436 --> 07:08.551
It's now or never!

07:32.236 --> 07:34.352
Yes!

07:36.236 --> 07:37.988
All clear! Bring the bombs.

07:38.076 --> 07:39.076
Captain,

07:39.716 --> 07:41.513
Resistance bombers approaching.

07:41.916 --> 07:42.985
Of course they are.

07:56.076 --> 07:57.476
Bombers, keep that tight formation.

07:57.596 --> 07:59.632
Fighters, protect the bombers.

07:59.796 --> 08:01.332
It's not every day we
get a shot at a dreadnought,

08:01.356 --> 08:02.391
so let's make this count.

08:02.516 --> 08:03.551
Copy that, Blue Leader.

08:03.716 --> 08:05.716
You get us there,
we'll give it to them.

08:05.756 --> 08:07.756
- Copy. We're on it.
- Fighters incoming.

08:09.836 --> 08:11.349
Gunners, look alive.

08:13.516 --> 08:14.692
Snubfighters at two-ten!

08:14.716 --> 08:15.852
- They're coming in!
- Form up!

08:15.876 --> 08:17.275
They're everywhere!

08:17.676 --> 08:18.676
Here they come.

08:18.756 --> 08:19.812
Incoming fighters.
Form up.

08:19.836 --> 08:21.236
Vector in at attack speed.

08:21.276 --> 08:22.994
- Pull up!
- Flank right.

08:24.236 --> 08:26.830
Mayday! Mayday!
Mayday! We're going down!

08:27.316 --> 08:29.386
Recharge the auto-cannons.

08:29.836 --> 08:31.554
Target their cruiser.

08:37.196 --> 08:39.266
I see it. Tallie,
they've targeted the fleet

08:39.436 --> 08:41.074
and begun the priming sequence.

08:41.236 --> 08:42.271
Copy that.

08:42.436 --> 08:43.436
We're almost there.

08:44.916 --> 08:47.908
Bombardiers, begin your drop sequence.

08:54.276 --> 08:56.036
I've got a visual on the target.

08:56.116 --> 08:58.550
We're approaching the sweet spot.

09:00.796 --> 09:02.876
Bombs are armed.

09:25.516 --> 09:28.110
- Auto-cannons aimed.
- Forty seconds to full charge.

09:28.276 --> 09:30.631
Destroy that last bomber!

09:35.756 --> 09:38.429
Paige, come in.
We're over the target.

09:38.636 --> 09:39.892
Why aren't your bay doors open?

09:39.916 --> 09:42.191
You're the only bomber left.
It's all down to you!

09:51.516 --> 09:52.915
- Nix!
- Paige!

09:53.076 --> 09:54.907
Drop the payload now!

10:04.196 --> 10:05.265
Look out!

10:07.076 --> 10:08.304
No!

11:10.156 --> 11:11.305
Bombs away!

11:38.836 --> 11:40.952
Direct hit! Dreadnought down!

12:15.556 --> 12:17.052
General, Supreme Leader Snoke

12:17.076 --> 12:19.192
is making contact from his ship.

12:20.756 --> 12:21.756
Excellent.

12:22.876 --> 12:25.515
I'll take it in my chambers.

12:26.276 --> 12:28.710
General Hux.

12:28.796 --> 12:31.788
Ah, good. Supreme Lea...

12:35.636 --> 12:36.864
My disappointment

12:36.956 --> 12:41.472
in your performance cannot be overstated.

12:41.636 --> 12:43.786
They can't get away, Supreme Leader.

12:44.876 --> 12:48.152
We have them tied on the end of a string.

12:59.196 --> 13:00.311
Rey!

13:16.956 --> 13:18.355
Well done, pal.

13:22.076 --> 13:25.148
"Finn naked leaking bag"?
What? Did you fry a chip?

13:32.516 --> 13:34.234
Finn! Finn, buddy.

13:35.116 --> 13:36.469
It's so good to see you.

13:36.636 --> 13:37.671
What? Let's...

13:37.876 --> 13:40.913
We need to get you dressed.
Come on.

13:41.076 --> 13:42.452
You must have a thousand questions.

13:42.476 --> 13:43.750
Where's Rey?

14:46.716 --> 14:48.354
Master Skywalker?

15:12.316 --> 15:14.227
Master Skywalker?

15:15.876 --> 15:17.514
I'm from the Resistance.

15:17.676 --> 15:20.554
Your sister Leia sent me.
We need your help.

15:29.316 --> 15:30.988
Hello?

16:02.316 --> 16:03.795
Go away.

16:10.596 --> 16:12.075
Chewie, what are you doing here?

16:12.836 --> 16:14.236
He said you're coming back with us.

16:14.356 --> 16:15.356
How did you find me?

16:15.516 --> 16:17.188
Long story.
We'll tell you on the Falcon.

16:18.396 --> 16:19.749
Falcon?

16:22.356 --> 16:23.755
Wait.

16:27.076 --> 16:28.987
Where's Han?

16:34.076 --> 16:37.910
Tied on a string indeed,
General Hux. Well done.

16:38.076 --> 16:41.273
The Resistance will soon
be in our grasp.

16:41.476 --> 16:43.671
Thank you, Supreme Leader.

16:51.276 --> 16:54.074
You wonder why I keep a rabid cur

16:54.276 --> 16:57.586
in such a place of power?

16:57.756 --> 17:01.510
A cur's weakness,
properly manipulated,

17:01.676 --> 17:05.385
can be a sharp tool.

17:07.556 --> 17:09.228
How's your wound?

17:10.436 --> 17:11.585
It's nothing.

17:12.356 --> 17:13.356
Hmm.

17:15.116 --> 17:18.665
The mighty Kylo Ren.

17:19.596 --> 17:21.234
When I found you,

17:22.036 --> 17:25.995
I saw what all masters live to see.

17:26.156 --> 17:30.035
Raw, untamed power.

17:30.196 --> 17:35.634
And beyond that, something truly special.

17:36.396 --> 17:38.910
The potential of your bloodline.

17:39.916 --> 17:44.273
A new Vader.

17:49.996 --> 17:52.510
Now I fear

17:54.196 --> 17:56.835
I was mistaken.

17:59.076 --> 18:01.590
I've given everything I have to you.

18:02.636 --> 18:03.955
To the dark side.

18:04.116 --> 18:07.028
Take that ridiculous thing off.

18:16.236 --> 18:19.990
Yes, there it is.

18:21.396 --> 18:24.832
You have too much
of your father's heart in you,

18:24.916 --> 18:25.951
young Solo.

18:26.156 --> 18:27.748
I killed Han Solo.

18:29.036 --> 18:30.833
When the moment came,
I didn't hesitate.

18:30.996 --> 18:32.554
And look at you,

18:32.636 --> 18:35.946
the deed split your spirit to the bone.

18:36.116 --> 18:38.584
You were unbalanced,

18:38.796 --> 18:42.471
bested by a girl
who had never held a lightsaber!

18:42.676 --> 18:43.904
You failed!

18:47.116 --> 18:48.515
Skywalker lives.

18:49.796 --> 18:54.426
The seed of the Jedi Order lives.

18:54.596 --> 18:56.473
And as long as it does,

18:56.636 --> 18:59.946
hope lives in the galaxy.

19:00.156 --> 19:05.389
I thought you would be the one
to snuff it out.

19:06.596 --> 19:09.633
Alas, you're no Vader.

19:10.796 --> 19:13.310
You're just a child

19:15.236 --> 19:17.431
in a mask.

19:50.236 --> 19:51.271
Prepare my ship.

19:57.236 --> 19:58.988
There's no light
left in Kylo Ren.

19:59.956 --> 20:01.548
He's only getting stronger.

20:01.756 --> 20:05.465
The First Order will control
all the major systems within weeks.

20:05.676 --> 20:07.632
We need your help.

20:07.796 --> 20:10.390
We need the Jedi Order back.

20:12.796 --> 20:15.151
We need Luke Skywalker.

20:18.956 --> 20:21.709
You don't need Luke Skywalker.

20:22.556 --> 20:23.875
Did you hear a word I just said?

20:23.956 --> 20:24.956
You think what?

20:25.156 --> 20:29.752
I'm gonna walk out with a laser sword
and face down the whole First Order?

20:30.796 --> 20:33.594
What did you think
was going to happen here?

20:33.676 --> 20:34.711
You think that I came

20:34.796 --> 20:38.994
to the most unfindable place
in the galaxy for no reason at all?

20:39.476 --> 20:40.909
Go away.

20:41.476 --> 20:43.273
I'm not leaving without you!

21:51.236 --> 21:52.351
Careful!

22:28.476 --> 22:29.909
You're wasting your time.

23:47.596 --> 23:49.427
Who are you?

23:53.196 --> 23:55.391
I know this place.

24:01.116 --> 24:03.789
Built a thousand generations ago

24:04.556 --> 24:06.865
to keep these.

24:07.596 --> 24:10.235
The original Jedi texts.

24:12.556 --> 24:17.266
Just like me,
they're the last of the Jedi religion.

24:20.836 --> 24:22.189
You've seen this place.

24:22.356 --> 24:24.233
You've seen this island.

24:24.836 --> 24:26.827
Only in dreams.

24:27.956 --> 24:29.833
Who are you?

24:30.236 --> 24:31.236
The Resistance sent me.

24:31.396 --> 24:32.590
They sent you?

24:32.996 --> 24:34.987
What's special about you?

24:36.836 --> 24:38.792
- Where are you from?
- Nowhere.

24:39.316 --> 24:41.750
- No one's from nowhere.
- Jakku.

24:41.956 --> 24:44.709
All right,
that is pretty much nowhere.

24:44.916 --> 24:47.510
Why are you here, Rey,
from nowhere?

24:47.676 --> 24:48.711
The Resistance sent me.

24:49.956 --> 24:50.991
We need your help.

24:51.076 --> 24:52.292
The First Order's become unstoppable.

24:52.316 --> 24:54.955
Why are you here?

25:07.556 --> 25:10.946
Something inside me has always been there.

25:13.436 --> 25:15.267
But now it's awake.

25:17.236 --> 25:18.715
And I'm afraid.

25:19.916 --> 25:20.985
I don't know what it is

25:21.676 --> 25:23.507
or what to do with it.

25:23.676 --> 25:25.075
And I need help.

25:25.876 --> 25:27.946
You need a teacher.

25:29.036 --> 25:30.185
I can't teach you.

25:30.996 --> 25:32.031
Why not?

25:33.396 --> 25:35.352
I've seen your daily routine.
You're not busy.

25:35.516 --> 25:39.270
I will never train
another generation of Jedi.

25:39.716 --> 25:41.911
I came to this island to die.

25:43.556 --> 25:46.628
It's time for the Jedi to end.

25:47.476 --> 25:48.670
Why?

25:49.876 --> 25:52.344
Leia sent me here with hope.

25:52.516 --> 25:55.349
If she was wrong,
she deserves to know why.

25:56.436 --> 25:57.710
We all do.

26:27.356 --> 26:29.392
- You're demoted.
- What? Wait!

26:29.556 --> 26:31.786
- We took down a dreadnought.
- At what cost?

26:31.956 --> 26:33.674
You start an attack,
you follow it through.

26:33.836 --> 26:35.428
Poe, get your head out of your cockpit.

26:35.596 --> 26:38.633
There are things that you cannot solve

26:38.796 --> 26:41.708
by jumping in an X-wing
and blowing something up!

26:41.876 --> 26:43.832
I need you to learn that.

26:44.916 --> 26:46.713
There were heroes on that mission.

26:46.876 --> 26:48.355
Dead heroes.

26:49.116 --> 26:50.515
No leaders.

26:55.916 --> 26:57.907
We're really nowhere.

26:58.076 --> 26:59.907
How's Rey gonna find us now?

27:02.436 --> 27:03.835
A cloaked binary beacon.

27:03.996 --> 27:05.509
To light her way home.

27:07.036 --> 27:09.072
All right, so until she gets back,
what's the plan?

27:09.236 --> 27:11.033
We need to find a new base.

27:11.196 --> 27:12.231
One with enough power

27:12.356 --> 27:16.065
to get a distress signal
to our allies scattered in the Outer Rim.

27:17.996 --> 27:19.748
Proximity alert!

27:20.036 --> 27:21.036
They found us.

27:21.236 --> 27:22.635
That's impossible.

27:35.156 --> 27:36.987
That's Snoke's ship.

27:37.156 --> 27:38.555
You gotta be kidding me.

27:38.996 --> 27:40.452
- Can we jump to lightspeed?
- We have enough

27:40.476 --> 27:41.796
fuel resources for just one jump.

27:41.956 --> 27:43.292
Well, then, do it.
We gotta get out of here.

27:43.316 --> 27:44.635
Wait.

27:45.756 --> 27:48.316
They've tracked us through lightspeed.

27:49.596 --> 27:50.596
That's impossible.

27:51.116 --> 27:52.116
Yes.

27:53.916 --> 27:55.588
And they've done it.

27:56.756 --> 27:57.852
So if we jump through lightspeed,

27:57.876 --> 27:59.772
they'll just find us again
and we'll be out of fuel.

27:59.796 --> 28:00.796
They've got us.

28:00.956 --> 28:02.708
Not yet, they don't.

28:03.036 --> 28:05.156
Permission to jump in an X-wing
and blow something up?

28:05.236 --> 28:06.635
Permission granted.

28:06.796 --> 28:08.275
Admiral, swing us around!

28:08.436 --> 28:10.552
Full astern.
Rotate shields!

28:10.716 --> 28:13.753
To your stations! Move, move, move!

28:27.636 --> 28:28.636
Follow my lead.

28:33.556 --> 28:36.070
Green Squadron to launch position.

28:36.236 --> 28:38.352
Clear all launch traffic.

28:41.956 --> 28:44.026
Don't wait for me!
Jump in and fire her up!

28:44.236 --> 28:48.149
Technicians,
lock down supplies for launch conditions.

29:18.996 --> 29:20.827
Move! Move!

29:37.596 --> 29:38.995
Poe, are you all right?

29:39.156 --> 29:41.351
We need to get out of range
of those Star Destroyers.

29:41.516 --> 29:42.915
We need to what?

29:43.076 --> 29:44.429
Full engines ahead.

29:44.596 --> 29:48.271
Get out of range of the Star Destroyers
and the fighters will fall back.

29:48.436 --> 29:50.108
All craft, full engines!

29:50.276 --> 29:52.312
Concentrate rear shields.

30:50.796 --> 30:52.832
Ren, the Resistance
have pulled out of range.

30:53.036 --> 30:54.549
We can't cover you at this distance.

30:54.716 --> 30:57.071
Return to the fleet.

30:58.916 --> 31:01.305
What is the point of all this

31:01.476 --> 31:04.866
if we can't blow up three tiny cruisers?

31:05.036 --> 31:07.027
Well, they're faster and lighter, sir.

31:07.196 --> 31:09.076
They can't lose us,
but they can keep at a range

31:09.156 --> 31:11.356
where our cannons are ineffective
against their shields.

31:11.916 --> 31:14.635
Well, keep up the barrage.

31:14.796 --> 31:17.264
Let's at least remind them
that we're still here.

31:17.476 --> 31:18.545
Very good, sir.

31:18.716 --> 31:22.106
They won't last long
burning fuel like this.

31:22.276 --> 31:24.471
It's just a matter of time.

32:31.836 --> 32:33.872
Move! Out of the way, everybody!
Give room!

32:33.996 --> 32:36.305
Life signs are weak,
but she's fighting.

34:08.636 --> 34:09.636
Artoo?

34:10.476 --> 34:12.148
Artoo!

34:13.956 --> 34:15.389
Yes.

34:15.516 --> 34:16.972
Yeah, I know.

34:18.356 --> 34:20.426
Hey, sacred island, watch the language.

34:22.916 --> 34:24.952
Old friend.

34:26.676 --> 34:28.632
I wish I could make you understand.

34:29.676 --> 34:31.667
But I'm not coming back.

34:32.396 --> 34:35.752
Nothing can make me
change my mind.

34:40.036 --> 34:42.550
Years ago, you served my father
in the Clone Wars.

34:42.916 --> 34:45.476
Now he begs you to help him
in his struggle against the Empire.

34:45.636 --> 34:47.892
I regret that I am unable to present
my father's request to you in person...

34:47.916 --> 34:49.190
That was a cheap move.

34:49.596 --> 34:51.132
...but my ship
has fallen under attack,

34:51.156 --> 34:53.624
and I'm afraid my mission
to bring you to Alderaan has failed.

34:53.756 --> 34:55.712
This is our most desperate hour.

34:55.876 --> 34:57.389
Help me, Obi-Wan Kenobi.

34:58.516 --> 34:59.710
You're my only hope.

35:11.116 --> 35:13.789
Tomorrow at dawn.

35:14.516 --> 35:15.835
Three lessons.

35:15.996 --> 35:18.590
I will teach you the ways of the Jedi

35:19.276 --> 35:21.028
and why they need to end.

35:31.196 --> 35:32.515
General Organa,

35:33.516 --> 35:34.665
Leia,

35:34.836 --> 35:37.509
is unconscious but recovering.

35:38.916 --> 35:40.952
That's the only good news I have.

35:41.596 --> 35:45.874
Admiral Ackbar,
all our leadership, they're gone.

35:47.116 --> 35:48.996
Leia was the sole survivor
on the bridge.

35:49.196 --> 35:50.390
Oh, dear. Oh, dear!

35:50.556 --> 35:54.674
If she were here, she'd say
save your sorrow for after the fight.

35:55.876 --> 35:56.945
To that end,

35:57.996 --> 36:01.750
the chain of command is clear
as to who should take her place.

36:02.876 --> 36:04.514
Vice Admiral Holdo

36:04.956 --> 36:06.708
of the cruiser Ninka.

36:07.796 --> 36:09.229
Thank you, Commander.

36:15.556 --> 36:16.750
Four hundred of us

36:16.916 --> 36:18.429
on three ships.

36:19.956 --> 36:22.550
We're the very last
of the Resistance.

36:24.556 --> 36:26.786
But we're not alone.

36:26.956 --> 36:29.151
In every corner of the galaxy,

36:29.316 --> 36:32.114
the downtrodden and oppressed
know our symbol,

36:32.396 --> 36:34.148
and they put their hope in it.

36:34.916 --> 36:36.508
We are the spark

36:36.596 --> 36:40.145
that will light the fire that
will restore the Republic.

36:41.196 --> 36:45.667
That spark,
this Resistance, must survive.

36:46.676 --> 36:48.826
That is our mission.

36:50.316 --> 36:51.590
Now, to your stations.

36:54.196 --> 36:56.391
And may the Force be with us.

37:01.956 --> 37:03.230
That's Admiral Holdo?

37:04.236 --> 37:06.272
Battle of Chyron Belt Admiral Holdo?

37:09.636 --> 37:10.910
Not what I expected.

37:12.236 --> 37:14.591
Vice Admiral?
Commander Dameron.

37:14.756 --> 37:17.596
With our current fuel consumption,
there's a very limited amount of time

37:17.756 --> 37:19.612
that we can stay out of range
of those Star Destroyers.

37:19.636 --> 37:21.991
Very kind of you
to make me aware.

37:22.396 --> 37:23.532
Let's get me those fuel projections.

37:23.556 --> 37:25.876
And we need to shake 'em
before we can find a new base, so,

37:25.956 --> 37:27.309
what's our plan?

37:27.476 --> 37:29.273
Our plan, captain?

37:30.156 --> 37:31.828
Not commander, right?

37:31.996 --> 37:34.146
Wasn't it Leia's last official act
to demote you

37:34.316 --> 37:35.669
for your dreadnought plan

37:36.396 --> 37:38.671
where we lost our entire bombing fleet?

37:42.116 --> 37:43.435
"Captain." "Commander."

37:43.516 --> 37:44.876
You can call me whatever you like.

37:44.996 --> 37:46.634
I just wanna know what's going on.

37:47.316 --> 37:48.465
Of course you do.

37:48.956 --> 37:49.956
I understand.

37:50.556 --> 37:53.468
I've dealt with plenty
of trigger-happy flyboys like you.

37:53.996 --> 37:54.996
You're impulsive.

37:56.876 --> 37:57.991
Dangerous.

37:59.356 --> 38:00.948
And the last thing
we need right now.

38:01.996 --> 38:05.909
So stick to your post
and follow my orders.

38:18.996 --> 38:20.892
Turbolink banks seven and eight

38:20.916 --> 38:22.793
are offline due to maintenance.

38:56.556 --> 38:57.830
What are you doing here?

38:57.996 --> 38:59.395
Hey. Hi.

38:59.876 --> 39:02.390
Uh, I was...
You know, I was just...

39:02.556 --> 39:03.784
You're Finn!

39:04.756 --> 39:05.950
The Finn!

39:06.436 --> 39:08.188
- The Finn?
- Sorry.

39:08.556 --> 39:10.114
I work behind pipes all day.

39:10.556 --> 39:14.071
Doing talking with Resistance heroes
is not my forte.

39:15.236 --> 39:16.430
Doing...

39:16.596 --> 39:17.711
Doing talking.

39:18.916 --> 39:20.395
I'm Rose.

39:20.756 --> 39:21.871
Breathe.

39:21.956 --> 39:24.072
- Okay.
- Yeah.

39:24.236 --> 39:27.706
Look, I'm not a Resistance hero,
but it was nice talking to you, Rose.

39:31.116 --> 39:32.708
May the Force be with you.

39:33.716 --> 39:35.991
Wow. You, too.

39:37.476 --> 39:40.388
Okay. But you are a hero.

39:41.076 --> 39:44.034
You left the First Order,
what you did on the Starkiller Base...

39:44.196 --> 39:45.812
When we heard about it,
my sister Paige said,

39:45.836 --> 39:47.394
"Rose, that's a real hero."

39:48.036 --> 39:49.105
"Know right from wrong

39:49.236 --> 39:51.156
"and don't run away
when it gets hard," she said.

39:51.236 --> 39:52.332
You know...

39:52.356 --> 39:54.074
Just this morning, I've had to stun

39:54.156 --> 39:56.431
three people trying to
jump ship in this escape pod.

39:56.596 --> 39:58.666
- What?
- They were running away.

39:59.036 --> 40:00.185
That's disgraceful.

40:01.156 --> 40:02.271
I know.

40:05.276 --> 40:06.276
Anyway, uh...

40:06.436 --> 40:08.108
Gotta get back to
what I was doing, so...

40:08.276 --> 40:09.595
What were you doing?

40:10.196 --> 40:11.390
Uh, just...

40:11.476 --> 40:13.356
- Doing some checks.
- Checking the escape pods.

40:13.476 --> 40:15.831
- No, it's routine checks.
- By boarding one

40:17.596 --> 40:18.995
with a packed bag.

40:19.716 --> 40:20.716
Okay.

40:20.876 --> 40:21.932
Listen, I'm...

40:35.676 --> 40:37.587
I can't move.
I can't move.

40:37.756 --> 40:39.633
- I know.
- What happened?

40:39.796 --> 40:41.732
I'm taking you to the brig
and turning you in for desertion.

40:41.756 --> 40:42.905
I was not deserting.

40:43.076 --> 40:45.306
- I told you that...
- My sister just died

40:45.476 --> 40:47.068
protecting the fleet.

40:47.236 --> 40:49.147
And you were running away.

40:50.196 --> 40:51.311
I'm sorry.

40:51.716 --> 40:52.716
But this fleet is doomed,

40:52.796 --> 40:55.026
and if my friend comes back to it,
she's doomed, too.

40:55.356 --> 40:56.471
I've gotta get this...

40:57.956 --> 40:59.833
I gotta get this beacon
far away from here.

40:59.996 --> 41:01.349
Then she'll find me and be safe.

41:02.196 --> 41:04.073
You're a selfish traitor.

41:04.516 --> 41:06.236
Look, we can't outrun
the First Order fleet.

41:06.436 --> 41:07.710
We can jump to lightspeed!

41:07.876 --> 41:09.492
Well, they can track us
through lightspeed.

41:09.516 --> 41:10.572
They can track us through lightspeed?

41:10.596 --> 41:11.596
Yeah.

41:11.676 --> 41:12.732
They'd just show up
thirty seconds later

41:12.756 --> 41:13.812
and we'd have
blown a ton of fuel,

41:13.836 --> 41:15.952
which, by the way,
we're dangerously short on.

41:16.636 --> 41:18.354
They can track us through lightspeed.

41:18.676 --> 41:19.676
Yes. And they could...

41:20.196 --> 41:21.196
I can't feel my teeth.

41:21.756 --> 41:23.155
What did you shoot me with?

41:23.316 --> 41:24.316
Active tracking.

41:24.476 --> 41:25.511
What now?

41:26.156 --> 41:27.372
Hyperspace tracking is new tech

41:27.396 --> 41:29.910
but the principle must be
the same as any active tracker.

41:30.076 --> 41:31.812
- They're only tracking us...
- Only tracking us...

41:31.836 --> 41:33.110
...from the lead ship.

41:33.276 --> 41:34.675
But we can't get to the tracker.

41:34.756 --> 41:36.932
It's an A-class process,
they'll control it from the main bridge.

41:36.956 --> 41:38.412
Well, I mean, yes,
but every A-class process...

41:38.436 --> 41:40.825
...has a dedicated power breaker.

41:41.356 --> 41:43.824
But... Wait, but who knows
where the breaker room

41:43.916 --> 41:44.916
is on a Star Destroyer?

41:47.196 --> 41:49.073
I'm the guy that used to mop it.

41:49.556 --> 41:50.784
If I can get us there,

41:51.276 --> 41:53.107
I can shut their tracker down.

41:53.636 --> 41:55.592
Just give it to me
one more time, simpler.

41:55.756 --> 41:59.066
So, the First Order's only tracking us
from one Destroyer, the lead one.

41:59.236 --> 42:00.305
So we blow that one up?

42:00.476 --> 42:01.812
I like where your head's at, but no.

42:01.836 --> 42:03.652
They'd only start tracking us
from another Destroyer.

42:03.676 --> 42:04.676
But if we can...

42:04.756 --> 42:07.012
If we sneak on board the lead Destroyer
and disable the tracker

42:07.036 --> 42:08.372
without them realizing, then we can...

42:08.396 --> 42:10.466
They won't realize it's off
for one system cycle.

42:10.636 --> 42:13.025
- About six minutes.
- Sneak on board.

42:15.356 --> 42:16.869
Disable the tracker.

42:18.276 --> 42:20.471
Our fleet escapes before they realize.

42:22.876 --> 42:23.876
Hmm.

42:28.876 --> 42:29.876
How'd you two meet?

42:32.836 --> 42:33.836
Just luck.

42:35.596 --> 42:36.665
Yeah?

42:36.956 --> 42:38.184
Good luck?

42:38.636 --> 42:39.785
Not sure yet.

42:40.276 --> 42:41.629
Poe, we gotta do this.

42:41.796 --> 42:43.991
It'll save the fleet and it'll save Rey.

42:45.756 --> 42:48.316
If I must be
the sole voice of reason,

42:48.476 --> 42:50.467
Admiral Holdo will never
agree to this plan.

42:51.836 --> 42:54.270
Yeah, you're right, Threepio.

42:54.436 --> 42:56.996
It's a "need-to-know" plan,
and she doesn't.

42:57.156 --> 42:58.794
- That wasn't exactly my...
- All right,

42:58.956 --> 43:00.309
you guys shut down that tracker.

43:00.476 --> 43:01.996
I'll be here to jump us to lightspeed.

43:02.116 --> 43:03.116
The question is,

43:03.276 --> 43:05.396
how do we sneak the two of you
onto Snoke's Destroyer?

43:05.516 --> 43:06.652
We steal clearance codes.

43:06.676 --> 43:08.756
No, they're bio-hexacrypt
and rescrambled every hour.

43:10.516 --> 43:13.076
We can't get through their
security shields undetected.

43:13.756 --> 43:14.984
Nobody can.

43:18.836 --> 43:20.349
Could I do it?

43:20.516 --> 43:22.746
Of course I could do it.
But I can't do it.

43:23.116 --> 43:24.788
I'm a little tied down right now.

43:24.876 --> 43:26.150
Oh!

43:26.236 --> 43:28.147
Maz? What is happening?

43:28.236 --> 43:31.592
Union dispute.
You do not want to hear about it.

43:31.676 --> 43:33.428
But, lucky for you,

43:33.596 --> 43:37.350
there's exactly one guy I trust
who can crack that kind of security!

43:39.836 --> 43:41.474
He's a master codebreaker,

43:41.676 --> 43:44.668
an ace pilot,
a poet with a blaster.

43:47.276 --> 43:48.276
Oh, my.

43:48.476 --> 43:50.716
It sounds like this codebreaker fellow
can do everything.

43:50.876 --> 43:53.344
Oh, yes, he can.

43:54.756 --> 43:58.715
You'll find him with a red
plom bloom on his lapel

43:58.876 --> 44:01.470
rolling at a high stakes table

44:01.836 --> 44:03.827
in the casino on Canto Bight.

44:03.996 --> 44:06.988
Canto Bight? No, no.
That's... Maz...

44:07.156 --> 44:09.132
Is there any way that we can
take care of this ourselves?

44:09.156 --> 44:11.829
Sorry, kiddo.
This is rarefied cracking.

44:12.356 --> 44:13.709
You wanna get on that Destroyer,

44:13.836 --> 44:15.349
I only know one option.

44:15.876 --> 44:18.390
Find the Master Codebreaker.

45:46.716 --> 45:49.105
You'll bring Luke Skywalker to me.

45:55.316 --> 45:57.591
You're not doing this.
The effort would kill you.

46:02.596 --> 46:03.716
Can you see my surroundings?

46:03.836 --> 46:05.349
You're gonna pay for what you did!

46:05.516 --> 46:06.790
I can't see yours.

46:08.476 --> 46:09.670
Just you.

46:11.916 --> 46:13.315
So, no.

46:14.956 --> 46:17.311
This is something else.

46:23.276 --> 46:24.276
Luke.

46:24.636 --> 46:26.388
What's that about?

46:40.996 --> 46:43.385
I was cleaning my blaster.
It went off.

46:46.436 --> 46:47.585
Let's get started.

46:51.756 --> 46:53.235
Who were those things?

46:54.036 --> 46:55.355
Caretakers.

46:55.516 --> 46:56.631
Island natives.

46:56.796 --> 46:59.185
They've kept up the Jedi structures
since they were built.

46:59.916 --> 47:01.474
I don't think they like me.

47:01.636 --> 47:03.308
Can't imagine why.

47:39.276 --> 47:40.595
Master Skywalker,

47:41.116 --> 47:42.412
we need you to bring the Jedi back

47:42.436 --> 47:45.234
because Kylo Ren is strong
with the dark side of the Force.

47:45.396 --> 47:47.864
Without the Jedi, we won't
stand a chance against him.

47:48.036 --> 47:50.345
What do you know
about the Force?

47:50.876 --> 47:53.709
It's a power that Jedi have
that lets them control people

47:54.436 --> 47:55.869
and make things float.

47:55.956 --> 47:56.956
Impressive.

47:57.116 --> 47:59.072
Every word in that sentence was wrong.

47:59.596 --> 48:02.827
Lesson one, sit here, legs crossed.

48:09.676 --> 48:12.748
The Force is not a power you have.

48:12.916 --> 48:15.225
It's not about lifting rocks.

48:15.596 --> 48:17.427
It's the energy between all things,

48:17.596 --> 48:19.666
a tension, a balance,

48:19.836 --> 48:22.111
that binds the universe together.

48:22.276 --> 48:23.276
Okay.

48:24.436 --> 48:25.585
But what is it?

48:27.076 --> 48:28.270
Close your eyes.

48:30.196 --> 48:31.549
Breathe.

48:32.276 --> 48:33.276
Now,

48:34.716 --> 48:35.865
reach out.

48:42.636 --> 48:43.671
I feel something.

48:43.796 --> 48:44.852
- You feel it?
- Yes, I feel it.

48:44.876 --> 48:45.996
- That's the Force.
- Really?

48:46.036 --> 48:47.652
Wow, it must be
really strong with you.

48:47.676 --> 48:48.676
I've never felt any...

48:48.836 --> 48:49.836
Ow!

48:52.676 --> 48:53.904
You meant reach out like...

48:56.556 --> 48:57.556
I'll try again.

49:00.076 --> 49:01.076
Breathe.

49:03.316 --> 49:05.193
Just breathe.

49:08.356 --> 49:10.586
Reach out with your feelings.

49:15.956 --> 49:17.150
What do you see?

49:21.236 --> 49:22.236
The island.

49:24.156 --> 49:25.191
Life.

49:26.556 --> 49:27.875
Death and decay,

49:29.436 --> 49:30.869
that feeds new life.

49:32.556 --> 49:33.591
Warmth.

49:34.716 --> 49:35.716
Cold.

49:37.996 --> 49:39.395
Peace.

49:40.996 --> 49:42.270
Violence.

49:43.316 --> 49:44.795
And between it all?

49:45.596 --> 49:46.596
Balance.

49:47.356 --> 49:48.584
An energy.

49:51.796 --> 49:53.229
A Force.

49:54.876 --> 49:56.468
And inside you?

49:57.636 --> 49:59.228
Inside me

50:00.396 --> 50:02.466
that same Force.

50:03.956 --> 50:06.754
And this is the lesson.

50:06.916 --> 50:10.033
That Force does not
belong to the Jedi.

50:11.316 --> 50:14.069
To say that if the Jedi die,
the light dies, is vanity.

50:14.276 --> 50:16.392
Can you feel that?

50:18.156 --> 50:19.794
There's something else

50:21.836 --> 50:23.269
beneath the island.

50:24.196 --> 50:25.196
A place.

50:26.556 --> 50:27.705
A dark place.

50:29.836 --> 50:30.951
Balance.

50:31.716 --> 50:33.547
Powerful light, powerful darkness.

50:33.916 --> 50:35.031
It's cold.

50:40.796 --> 50:41.865
It's calling me.

50:43.196 --> 50:44.231
Resist it, Rey.

50:45.356 --> 50:46.550
Rey?

50:49.156 --> 50:50.156
Rey!

50:58.996 --> 51:00.793
You went straight to the dark.

51:02.156 --> 51:03.836
That place was trying
to show me something.

51:03.876 --> 51:05.707
It offered something you needed.

51:06.316 --> 51:08.625
And you didn't even try
to stop yourself.

51:09.796 --> 51:11.388
But I didn't see you.

51:13.356 --> 51:15.028
Nothing from you.

51:18.476 --> 51:20.785
You've closed yourself off
from the Force.

51:24.356 --> 51:25.709
Of course you have.

51:27.076 --> 51:30.148
I've seen this raw strength
only once before,

51:30.676 --> 51:32.428
in Ben Solo.

51:32.596 --> 51:34.314
It didn't scare me enough then.

51:35.516 --> 51:37.029
It does now.

51:49.436 --> 51:50.436
What was that?

51:50.596 --> 51:51.790
Nothing, admiral.

51:51.996 --> 51:53.349
Passing debris.

52:00.676 --> 52:02.507
The fleet's only got
18 hours of fuel left.

52:02.916 --> 52:04.235
We gotta hurry.

52:05.556 --> 52:07.512
Still can't reach the Resistance?

52:07.596 --> 52:09.268
Keep at it.

52:09.476 --> 52:11.114
If you get through, check their status.

52:11.276 --> 52:12.595
And ask about Finn.

52:47.796 --> 52:49.752
Why is the Force connecting us?

52:50.116 --> 52:51.116
You and I.

52:51.276 --> 52:52.675
Murderous snake.

52:53.436 --> 52:56.473
You're too late.
You lost. I found Skywalker.

52:57.756 --> 52:58.956
Did he tell you what happened?

53:00.356 --> 53:02.506
The night I destroyed his temple,
did he tell you why?

53:02.676 --> 53:05.270
I know everything
I need to know about you.

53:05.436 --> 53:06.949
You do?

53:09.516 --> 53:11.427
Ah, you do.

53:12.716 --> 53:14.627
You have that look in your eyes.

53:14.796 --> 53:16.593
From the forest.

53:19.276 --> 53:20.504
When you called me a monster.

53:20.676 --> 53:22.792
You are a monster.

53:28.036 --> 53:29.389
Yes, I am.

53:53.716 --> 53:54.716
Okay.

53:54.916 --> 53:57.146
We get in, we find this codebreaker,
we get out.

53:57.316 --> 53:59.511
You know this town? Canto Bight?

53:59.676 --> 54:00.870
From stories.

54:01.036 --> 54:04.472
It's a terrible place filled with
the worst people in the galaxy.

54:04.596 --> 54:05.596
Great.

54:26.836 --> 54:28.474
I told those two, I said,

54:28.636 --> 54:31.309
"This is a public beach.
You can't park that shuttle here."

54:31.476 --> 54:34.070
But they just lit off toward the casino.

54:41.196 --> 54:42.629
Place your bets.
Place your bets.

54:42.836 --> 54:44.588
All bets on the table
right now, right now!

54:44.716 --> 54:45.751
Place your bets here.

54:59.396 --> 55:02.513
Aw, yes!
This place is great!

55:03.156 --> 55:04.475
Okay.

55:06.796 --> 55:10.345
Maz said this Master Codebreaker
would have a red plom bloom on his lapel.

55:10.516 --> 55:12.268
Let's find him and get out of here.

55:12.436 --> 55:14.472
Well played.
The house wins.

55:15.756 --> 55:16.812
Where are
your manners, more like?

55:16.836 --> 55:17.905
Come on!

55:41.676 --> 55:42.732
We've covered this whole casino.

55:42.756 --> 55:43.756
Zero red plom blooms.

55:43.836 --> 55:45.476
Where is this guy?

55:50.236 --> 55:51.908
Were those what I think they were?

55:59.116 --> 56:01.107
- What are those things?
- Fathiers.

56:02.036 --> 56:03.549
I've never seen a real one.

56:04.236 --> 56:06.875
Look, this whole place is beautiful.
I mean, come on.

56:07.636 --> 56:09.274
Why do you hate it so much?

56:10.236 --> 56:11.510
Look closer.

56:16.716 --> 56:19.549
My sister and I grew up
in a poor mining system.

56:21.196 --> 56:24.472
The First Order stripped our ore
to finance their military

56:25.876 --> 56:27.992
then shelled us
to test their weapons.

56:34.036 --> 56:36.106
They took everything we had.

56:37.436 --> 56:39.996
And who do you think
these people are?

56:40.476 --> 56:43.912
There's only one business in the galaxy
that'll get you this rich.

56:44.596 --> 56:45.711
War.

56:46.196 --> 56:48.551
Selling weapons to the First Order.

56:50.556 --> 56:55.311
I wish I could put my fist through this
whole lousy, beautiful town.

57:02.756 --> 57:03.791
Red plom bloom!

57:12.036 --> 57:13.071
Red plom bloom!

57:13.276 --> 57:14.425
The Master Codebreaker!

57:20.796 --> 57:22.354
Yep, those are the shuttle parkers.

57:23.556 --> 57:24.556
All right.

57:24.676 --> 57:29.113
You two are under arrest
for parking violation 27B/6.

57:29.276 --> 57:30.332
You have the right to remain...

57:30.356 --> 57:32.472
- What was that?
- No, no, no. Not now, Lovey.

57:32.556 --> 57:33.591
I'm on a roll.

59:17.636 --> 59:18.989
Lesson two.

59:19.196 --> 59:23.348
Now that they're extinct,
the Jedi are romanticized, deified.

59:23.836 --> 59:26.589
But if you strip away the myth
and look at their deeds,

59:27.076 --> 59:29.112
the legacy of the Jedi is failure.

59:29.436 --> 59:30.585
Hypocrisy, hubris.

59:30.716 --> 59:31.716
That's not true.

59:31.916 --> 59:34.476
At the height of their powers,
they allowed Darth Sidious to rise

59:34.596 --> 59:36.473
create the Empire, and wipe them out.

59:36.876 --> 59:38.787
It was a Jedi Master
who was responsible

59:38.956 --> 59:42.073
for the training
and creation of Darth Vader.

59:42.236 --> 59:43.749
And a Jedi who saved him.

59:44.436 --> 59:45.994
Yes, the most hated man in the galaxy.

59:46.156 --> 59:48.351
But you saw there was conflict inside him.

59:48.556 --> 59:51.150
You believed that he wasn't gone.
That he could be turned.

59:51.516 --> 59:53.188
And I became a legend.

59:54.556 --> 59:56.706
For many years, there was balance

59:56.876 --> 59:58.275
and then I saw

59:58.556 --> 59:59.556
Ben.

01:00:00.996 --> 01:00:04.671
My nephew
with that mighty Skywalker blood.

01:00:04.836 --> 01:00:06.189
And in my hubris,

01:00:06.356 --> 01:00:09.507
I thought I could train him,
I could pass on my strengths.

01:00:10.716 --> 01:00:14.026
Han was Han about it, but...

01:00:16.596 --> 01:00:18.109
Leia

01:00:19.556 --> 01:00:21.911
trusted me with her son.

01:00:22.716 --> 01:00:23.716
I took him,

01:00:24.756 --> 01:00:26.508
and a dozen students,

01:00:27.556 --> 01:00:29.069
and began a training temple.

01:00:31.236 --> 01:00:33.227
By the time I realized

01:00:33.356 --> 01:00:36.553
I was no match for
the darkness rising in him,

01:00:37.156 --> 01:00:38.714
it was too late.

01:00:40.036 --> 01:00:41.389
What happened?

01:00:44.836 --> 01:00:46.315
I went to confront him.

01:00:48.596 --> 01:00:50.268
And he turned on me.

01:00:50.676 --> 01:00:52.155
Ben, no!

01:00:55.276 --> 01:00:57.392
He must have thought
I was dead.

01:00:59.076 --> 01:01:00.304
When I came to,

01:01:02.396 --> 01:01:04.068
the temple was burning.

01:01:05.516 --> 01:01:08.189
He had vanished
with a handful of my students.

01:01:09.276 --> 01:01:11.471
And slaughtered the rest.

01:01:12.916 --> 01:01:14.907
Leia blamed Snoke,

01:01:15.596 --> 01:01:16.824
but it was me.

01:01:17.556 --> 01:01:18.955
I failed.

01:01:22.476 --> 01:01:25.513
Because I was Luke Skywalker.

01:01:26.436 --> 01:01:28.347
Jedi Master.

01:01:33.676 --> 01:01:35.348
A legend.

01:01:37.556 --> 01:01:39.831
The galaxy may need a legend.

01:01:44.436 --> 01:01:48.714
I need someone to show me
my place in all this.

01:01:54.556 --> 01:01:56.274
And you didn't fail Kylo.

01:01:56.476 --> 01:01:58.114
Kylo failed you.

01:01:58.836 --> 01:02:00.508
I won't.

01:02:21.196 --> 01:02:24.029
The main cruiser's
still keeping beyond range.

01:02:24.516 --> 01:02:26.347
But their medical frigate is out of fuel

01:02:27.476 --> 01:02:29.228
and its shields are down.

01:02:29.396 --> 01:02:31.273
The beginning of their end.

01:02:32.756 --> 01:02:34.508
Destroy it.

01:02:37.556 --> 01:02:40.866
The last of our crew has been evacuated
and heading your way.

01:02:41.916 --> 01:02:43.554
It's been an honor, admiral.

01:02:43.716 --> 01:02:45.593
Godspeed, Rebels!

01:02:48.956 --> 01:02:49.991
Admiral,

01:02:50.716 --> 01:02:52.672
fuel reserves at six hours.

01:02:54.476 --> 01:02:56.512
Maintain our current course.

01:02:57.356 --> 01:02:59.028
Steady on.

01:03:04.116 --> 01:03:05.116
Finn,

01:03:05.276 --> 01:03:07.392
Rose, where are you guys?

01:03:12.756 --> 01:03:13.905
Deal me in.

01:03:17.036 --> 01:03:18.036
Thanks.

01:03:19.996 --> 01:03:23.193
Finn, the fleet
is running on fumes.

01:03:24.076 --> 01:03:26.829
Without a codebreaker
to break us onto Snoke's Star Destroyer...

01:03:28.036 --> 01:03:29.628
- What do we do?
- I don't know.

01:03:30.196 --> 01:03:32.790
Unless you got a thief in your pocket,
our plan is shot.

01:03:34.876 --> 01:03:36.195
Um, I can do it.

01:03:40.356 --> 01:03:41.356
What?

01:03:43.036 --> 01:03:44.151
What?

01:03:45.116 --> 01:03:46.116
What?

01:03:46.276 --> 01:03:47.868
S-S-Sorry, I just

01:03:48.276 --> 01:03:50.312
couldn't help but overhear all the stuff

01:03:50.396 --> 01:03:53.354
that you were saying really loudly

01:03:54.036 --> 01:03:55.389
while I was trying to sleep.

01:03:57.596 --> 01:03:58.995
Codebreaker?

01:03:59.956 --> 01:04:01.389
Thief?

01:04:02.356 --> 01:04:03.550
I can do it.

01:04:03.716 --> 01:04:06.469
We're not talking about
picking pockets, okay?

01:04:07.516 --> 01:04:09.427
Yeah.

01:04:11.396 --> 01:04:13.352
D-D-Don't let the wrapper
fool you, friend.

01:04:14.076 --> 01:04:17.591
Me and the First Order
codeage go way back.

01:04:19.516 --> 01:04:20.551
And,

01:04:22.276 --> 01:04:24.153
if the price is right,

01:04:25.476 --> 01:04:30.311
I could break you into
old man S-S-Snoke's boudoir.

01:04:32.116 --> 01:04:33.993
- No.
- We're... We got it covered.

01:04:37.636 --> 01:04:38.910
Ha-tuk-ga.

01:04:52.396 --> 01:04:54.148
- Did he just...
- Yeah.

01:04:55.716 --> 01:04:57.354
We gotta get out of here!
This way!

01:04:57.516 --> 01:04:58.585
Why you little...

01:05:03.716 --> 01:05:05.513
D-D-Did you do this?

01:05:08.636 --> 01:05:09.671
Hey, hands up!

01:05:10.836 --> 01:05:13.066
- Hands up!
- Yeah, man.

01:05:29.196 --> 01:05:30.788
What's your story, roundie?

01:05:31.516 --> 01:05:32.585
They went this way!

01:05:37.356 --> 01:05:39.347
- Lock down all the exits.
- Wait.

01:05:43.916 --> 01:05:45.508
That smelled great.

01:05:45.676 --> 01:05:47.507
Those cops will be here
any minute. What now?

01:05:53.156 --> 01:05:54.874
Whoa! Ooh!

01:06:20.836 --> 01:06:22.554
No, wait.
Please, don't!

01:06:29.956 --> 01:06:31.236
We're with the Resistance.

01:06:37.196 --> 01:06:39.152
Roger that.
Checking the stables now.

01:06:46.076 --> 01:06:47.076
This way.

01:06:47.156 --> 01:06:48.436
They must have
come through here.

01:06:54.316 --> 01:06:55.316
Hyah!

01:07:01.196 --> 01:07:03.187
Go, go, go! Whoo!

01:07:09.316 --> 01:07:10.836
Stop enjoying this!
Stop enjoying this!

01:07:17.316 --> 01:07:19.597
We've got them.
They're not going anywhere.

01:07:25.636 --> 01:07:26.636
Ahhh!

01:07:36.716 --> 01:07:37.716
Huh?

01:08:03.796 --> 01:08:05.476
Move, move, move!
Get out of the way!

01:08:07.236 --> 01:08:09.466
Our ship's on the beach straight ahead!

01:08:11.476 --> 01:08:12.476
We need cover!

01:08:23.356 --> 01:08:24.630
Too much cover!

01:08:37.156 --> 01:08:38.271
There it is!

01:08:40.956 --> 01:08:42.787
- No!
- Come on!

01:08:58.036 --> 01:09:00.116
Let the herd go.
Stick with the perps.

01:09:05.596 --> 01:09:06.631
Where'd they go?

01:09:09.876 --> 01:09:10.945
I think we lost him!

01:09:11.116 --> 01:09:12.932
Now we get down to the beach
and circle back around...

01:09:12.956 --> 01:09:13.956
Cliff!

01:09:24.116 --> 01:09:25.151
We're trapped.

01:09:28.116 --> 01:09:29.310
It was worth it, though.

01:09:29.956 --> 01:09:31.230
To tear up that town,

01:09:31.596 --> 01:09:32.824
make 'em hurt.

01:09:42.436 --> 01:09:43.436
Go.

01:09:48.476 --> 01:09:49.704
Now it's worth it.

01:09:59.996 --> 01:10:01.196
There they are.

01:10:06.636 --> 01:10:09.150
BB-8! Wait, are you flying that thing?

01:10:12.916 --> 01:10:14.190
Ah.

01:10:15.196 --> 01:10:16.868
N-N-Need a lift?

01:11:10.756 --> 01:11:11.756
Luke.

01:11:13.076 --> 01:11:14.225
Leia.

01:11:23.076 --> 01:11:24.953
I'd rather not do this now.

01:11:25.636 --> 01:11:26.989
Yeah, me, too.

01:11:29.356 --> 01:11:30.948
Why did you hate your father?

01:11:35.396 --> 01:11:36.396
Do you have something,

01:11:36.516 --> 01:11:37.996
a cowl or something you could put on?

01:11:41.676 --> 01:11:43.951
Why did you hate your father?
Give me an honest answer.

01:11:45.556 --> 01:11:48.070
You had a father who loved you,
he gave a damn about you.

01:11:48.276 --> 01:11:50.312
- I didn't hate him.
- Then why?

01:11:50.716 --> 01:11:51.716
Why what?

01:11:55.236 --> 01:11:56.669
Why what? Say it.

01:11:57.996 --> 01:11:59.315
Why did you...

01:12:00.116 --> 01:12:02.072
Why did you kill him?

01:12:02.516 --> 01:12:03.710
I don't understand.

01:12:03.876 --> 01:12:04.876
No?

01:12:05.036 --> 01:12:06.636
Your parents threw you away
like garbage.

01:12:06.836 --> 01:12:08.906
- They didn't!
- They did.

01:12:09.076 --> 01:12:10.873
But you can't stop needing them.

01:12:11.036 --> 01:12:12.264
It's your greatest weakness.

01:12:13.116 --> 01:12:14.236
Looking for them everywhere,

01:12:14.356 --> 01:12:15.550
in Han Solo,

01:12:16.036 --> 01:12:17.833
now in Skywalker.

01:12:21.236 --> 01:12:23.033
Did he tell you what happened
that night?

01:12:23.396 --> 01:12:24.396
Yes.

01:12:26.476 --> 01:12:27.545
No.

01:12:29.316 --> 01:12:30.954
He had sensed my power,

01:12:32.276 --> 01:12:33.994
as he senses yours.

01:12:35.276 --> 01:12:36.948
And he feared it.

01:12:53.796 --> 01:12:55.070
Liar.

01:12:59.516 --> 01:13:00.869
Let the past die.

01:13:02.476 --> 01:13:04.785
Kill it if you have to.

01:13:07.356 --> 01:13:10.075
That's the only way to become
what you were meant to be.

01:13:53.276 --> 01:13:55.187
No! No!

01:14:35.676 --> 01:14:37.075
Rey?

01:15:06.156 --> 01:15:08.829
I should have felt
trapped or panicked.

01:15:08.996 --> 01:15:10.475
But I didn't.

01:15:13.876 --> 01:15:14.916
This didn't go on forever,

01:15:14.956 --> 01:15:17.106
I knew it was leading somewhere.

01:15:17.876 --> 01:15:20.344
And that, at the end,
it would show me what I came to see.

01:15:22.516 --> 01:15:23.915
Rey.

01:15:32.436 --> 01:15:34.631
Let me see them.

01:15:35.116 --> 01:15:37.107
My parents,

01:15:37.276 --> 01:15:39.346
please.

01:16:14.476 --> 01:16:16.546
I thought I'd find answers here.

01:16:18.156 --> 01:16:19.509
I was wrong.

01:16:22.076 --> 01:16:23.828
I'd never felt so alone.

01:16:26.356 --> 01:16:27.755
You're not alone.

01:16:32.876 --> 01:16:34.195
Neither are you.

01:16:35.236 --> 01:16:36.555
Rey?

01:16:44.356 --> 01:16:46.028
It isn't too late.

01:17:43.756 --> 01:17:44.791
Stop!

01:17:54.156 --> 01:17:57.068
Is it true?
Did you try to murder him?

01:17:57.236 --> 01:17:59.670
Leave this island now!

01:17:59.836 --> 01:18:01.030
Stop.

01:18:02.316 --> 01:18:03.316
Stop!

01:18:07.876 --> 01:18:08.945
Did you do it?

01:18:09.156 --> 01:18:11.147
Did you create Kylo Ren?

01:18:40.836 --> 01:18:42.716
Tell me the truth.

01:18:48.636 --> 01:18:50.592
I saw darkness.

01:18:52.396 --> 01:18:54.307
I'd sensed it building in him.

01:18:54.476 --> 01:18:57.115
I'd seen it in moments
during his training.

01:18:57.636 --> 01:18:59.467
But then I looked inside,

01:18:59.916 --> 01:19:02.669
and it was beyond
what I ever imagined.

01:19:07.916 --> 01:19:10.066
Snoke had already turned his heart.

01:19:11.756 --> 01:19:14.509
He would bring destruction,
and pain, and death,

01:19:14.596 --> 01:19:17.633
and the end of everything I love
because of what he will become.

01:19:17.716 --> 01:19:19.593
And for the briefest moment
of pure instinct,

01:19:19.676 --> 01:19:21.951
I thought I could stop it.

01:19:24.036 --> 01:19:26.504
It passed like a fleeting shadow.

01:19:27.396 --> 01:19:29.273
And I was left with shame,

01:19:30.596 --> 01:19:32.552
and with consequence.

01:19:33.316 --> 01:19:35.193
And the last thing I saw

01:19:35.716 --> 01:19:37.627
were the eyes of a frightened boy

01:19:37.716 --> 01:19:40.184
whose master had failed him.

01:19:41.876 --> 01:19:42.876
Ben, no!

01:19:49.796 --> 01:19:51.912
You failed him by thinking
his choice was made.

01:19:51.996 --> 01:19:52.996
It wasn't.

01:19:53.436 --> 01:19:55.233
There's still conflict in him.

01:19:55.396 --> 01:19:58.035
If he were turned from the dark side,
that could shift the tide.

01:19:58.196 --> 01:19:59.948
This could be how we win.

01:20:00.116 --> 01:20:03.108
This is not going to go
the way you think.

01:20:03.636 --> 01:20:04.864
It is.

01:20:05.076 --> 01:20:07.829
Just now when we touched hands,

01:20:07.996 --> 01:20:09.270
I saw his future.

01:20:10.276 --> 01:20:11.914
As solid as I'm seeing you.

01:20:12.396 --> 01:20:15.911
If I go to him, Ben Solo will turn.

01:20:16.116 --> 01:20:17.231
Rey,

01:20:17.716 --> 01:20:19.786
don't do this.

01:20:35.676 --> 01:20:37.268
Then he's our last hope.

01:21:18.356 --> 01:21:19.789
Master Yoda.

01:21:20.636 --> 01:21:23.070
Young Skywalker.

01:21:25.356 --> 01:21:26.789
I'm ending all of this.

01:21:27.116 --> 01:21:29.584
The tree, the text, the Jedi.

01:21:29.756 --> 01:21:30.950
I'm gonna burn it down.

01:21:50.796 --> 01:21:51.945
Hmm.

01:22:08.356 --> 01:22:09.789
Ah, Skywalker.

01:22:09.876 --> 01:22:10.911
Missed you, have I.

01:22:24.116 --> 01:22:25.754
So it is time

01:22:27.316 --> 01:22:29.113
for the Jedi Order to end.

01:22:29.276 --> 01:22:31.506
Time it is.

01:22:32.116 --> 01:22:33.595
Hmm.

01:22:36.236 --> 01:22:41.833
For you to look past
a pile of old books, hmm?

01:22:41.916 --> 01:22:43.668
The sacred Jedi texts.

01:22:43.836 --> 01:22:45.986
Oh. Read them, have you?

01:22:46.716 --> 01:22:48.149
- Well, I...
- Page-turners

01:22:48.356 --> 01:22:49.584
they were not.

01:22:50.236 --> 01:22:52.113
Yes, yes, yes.

01:22:52.316 --> 01:22:53.635
Wisdom they held,

01:22:53.796 --> 01:22:57.266
but that library contained
nothing that the girl Rey

01:22:57.436 --> 01:22:59.347
does not already possess.

01:23:02.516 --> 01:23:04.188
Skywalker,

01:23:05.116 --> 01:23:07.027
still looking to the horizon.

01:23:07.196 --> 01:23:09.664
Never here, now, hmm?

01:23:09.876 --> 01:23:12.436
The need in front of your nose.

01:23:13.236 --> 01:23:14.236
Hmm?

01:23:16.116 --> 01:23:17.754
I was weak.

01:23:18.996 --> 01:23:19.996
Unwise.

01:23:20.156 --> 01:23:22.716
Lost Ben Solo, you did.

01:23:23.436 --> 01:23:25.870
Lose Rey, we must not.

01:23:26.316 --> 01:23:29.114
I can't be what she needs me to be.

01:23:29.756 --> 01:23:31.951
Heeded my words not, did you?

01:23:32.396 --> 01:23:34.910
Pass on what you have learned.

01:23:35.076 --> 01:23:37.192
Strength, mastery.

01:23:38.156 --> 01:23:39.748
But weakness,

01:23:39.916 --> 01:23:42.305
folly, failure also.

01:23:42.476 --> 01:23:45.593
Yes, failure most of all.

01:23:45.756 --> 01:23:48.714
The greatest teacher, failure is.

01:23:58.036 --> 01:23:59.036
Luke,

01:24:01.636 --> 01:24:05.026
we are what they grow beyond.

01:24:05.796 --> 01:24:09.994
That is the true burden of all masters.

01:24:23.236 --> 01:24:25.192
Four parsecs to go.
This thing really cooks.

01:24:25.356 --> 01:24:27.028
I just hope we're in time.

01:24:27.196 --> 01:24:28.595
You can actually do this, right?

01:24:29.156 --> 01:24:31.147
Yeah, about that...

01:24:34.916 --> 01:24:38.352
Guys, I can do it.

01:24:39.276 --> 01:24:41.995
But there exists a pre- "do it"
conversation about price.

01:24:42.756 --> 01:24:45.276
Once we're done, the Resistance
will give you whatever you want.

01:24:45.996 --> 01:24:47.036
What you got deposit-wise?

01:24:47.916 --> 01:24:50.111
Are you kidding me?
Look at us.

01:24:51.196 --> 01:24:52.948
Is that Haysian smelt?

01:24:55.596 --> 01:24:56.915
That's something.

01:24:57.076 --> 01:24:59.271
No, we gave you our word.
You're gonna get paid.

01:24:59.396 --> 01:25:00.590
That should be enough.

01:25:00.756 --> 01:25:02.030
Guys, I wanna keep helping.

01:25:03.156 --> 01:25:06.626
But no something, n-n-no doing.

01:25:06.796 --> 01:25:08.787
Okay, listen here, you've got...

01:25:09.356 --> 01:25:10.994
Do it.

01:25:14.036 --> 01:25:15.833
Now I can help.

01:25:18.316 --> 01:25:19.385
Give it back.

01:25:20.876 --> 01:25:21.876
What?

01:25:21.956 --> 01:25:24.026
Give it back!

01:25:24.196 --> 01:25:26.316
You have no idea how much
that medallion means to her.

01:25:26.636 --> 01:25:29.673
What are you... Why are you
ransacking your own ship?

01:25:32.116 --> 01:25:33.185
It's not your ship.

01:25:34.996 --> 01:25:36.031
He says I stole it.

01:25:36.196 --> 01:25:38.391
- Yeah, I got that.
- We stole it.

01:25:40.316 --> 01:25:42.546
At least you're stealing
from the bad guys

01:25:43.196 --> 01:25:44.196
and helping the good.

01:25:44.356 --> 01:25:46.312
Good guys, bad guys,

01:25:46.476 --> 01:25:48.512
made-up words.

01:25:49.236 --> 01:25:52.785
Let's see who formerly owned
this gorgeous hunk-uh.

01:25:55.916 --> 01:25:58.111
Ah, this guy was an arms dealer.

01:25:58.916 --> 01:26:02.113
Made his bank selling weapons
to the bad guys.

01:26:03.836 --> 01:26:04.836
Oh...

01:26:06.436 --> 01:26:07.915
And the good.

01:26:09.356 --> 01:26:12.268
Finn, let me learn you something big.

01:26:13.676 --> 01:26:15.792
It's all a machine, partner.

01:26:17.476 --> 01:26:20.309
Live free, don't join.

01:26:32.356 --> 01:26:34.745
That was the last of their support ships.

01:26:34.956 --> 01:26:36.276
It's just their main cruiser now.

01:26:36.556 --> 01:26:38.035
And their fuel reserve?

01:26:38.196 --> 01:26:39.914
By our calculation,

01:26:40.076 --> 01:26:41.555
critical.

01:26:45.796 --> 01:26:46.796
She in there?

01:26:46.876 --> 01:26:47.972
The admiral's banned you
from the bridge.

01:26:47.996 --> 01:26:49.476
- Let's not have a scene.
- No, let's.

01:26:49.596 --> 01:26:51.427
- Holdo?
- You're not allowed in here.

01:26:51.556 --> 01:26:53.945
- Flyboy.
- Cut it, lady.

01:26:54.036 --> 01:26:55.754
We had a fleet,
now we're down to one ship,

01:26:55.836 --> 01:26:57.554
and you've told us nothing!

01:26:58.036 --> 01:27:01.267
Tell us that we have a plan!

01:27:01.436 --> 01:27:02.436
That there's hope!

01:27:02.596 --> 01:27:03.995
When I served under Leia,

01:27:04.156 --> 01:27:06.624
she would say,
hope is like the sun.

01:27:06.796 --> 01:27:09.310
If you only believe in it
when you can see it...

01:27:09.476 --> 01:27:11.706
You'll never make it
through the night.

01:27:12.156 --> 01:27:13.475
Yes.

01:27:21.476 --> 01:27:23.592
Are you fueling up the transports?

01:27:29.116 --> 01:27:30.390
You are.

01:27:31.116 --> 01:27:32.344
All of them?

01:27:33.636 --> 01:27:36.230
We're abandoning ship? Is that...

01:27:36.636 --> 01:27:38.636
That's what you got?
That's what you brought us to?

01:27:39.236 --> 01:27:40.236
Coward!

01:27:41.116 --> 01:27:43.994
Those transport ships
are unarmed, unshielded.

01:27:44.156 --> 01:27:46.431
We abandon this cruiser, we're done.

01:27:46.596 --> 01:27:49.315
We don't stand a chance.
No, you are not just a coward,

01:27:49.476 --> 01:27:50.989
you are a traitor.

01:27:51.716 --> 01:27:53.946
Get this man off my bridge.

01:28:00.756 --> 01:28:03.132
Finn,
Holdo's loading the crew in the shuttle.

01:28:03.156 --> 01:28:04.953
She's going to abandon ship.
Where are you?

01:28:05.116 --> 01:28:06.834
Poe, we're on our way
back to the fleet.

01:28:06.996 --> 01:28:08.145
We're so close.

01:28:08.316 --> 01:28:09.492
Did you find the Master Codebreaker?

01:28:09.516 --> 01:28:11.632
Well, we found a codebreaker.

01:28:12.076 --> 01:28:13.212
We can shut the tracker down.

01:28:13.236 --> 01:28:15.227
Just buy us a little more time.

01:28:16.316 --> 01:28:17.954
All right. Hurry.

01:28:23.156 --> 01:28:25.036
As soon as I launch,
you jump back out of range.

01:28:25.076 --> 01:28:27.829
Stay there until you get my signal
for where to rendezvous.

01:28:29.636 --> 01:28:32.434
If you see Finn before I do,

01:28:32.516 --> 01:28:33.516
tell him...

01:28:35.716 --> 01:28:37.468
Yeah, perfect.
Tell him that.

01:29:44.476 --> 01:29:46.785
Cloaking our approach.
We should be off their scopes.

01:29:47.596 --> 01:29:49.905
Then we slice a slit in their shield.

01:29:50.076 --> 01:29:51.714
Blip bloppity bloop,

01:29:52.756 --> 01:29:54.712
and slip right through.

01:30:13.156 --> 01:30:16.273
So a stormtrooper
and a who now are doing what?

01:30:16.436 --> 01:30:17.585
They are trying to save us.

01:30:17.756 --> 01:30:19.348
This is our best chance for escape.

01:30:19.556 --> 01:30:21.612
You have to give Finn and Rose
all the time that you can.

01:30:21.636 --> 01:30:23.991
You have bet the survival
of the Resistance

01:30:24.156 --> 01:30:26.909
on bad odds and put us all at risk.

01:30:27.076 --> 01:30:28.225
There's no time now.

01:30:28.436 --> 01:30:30.492
We have to get clear of the cruiser.
Load the transports.

01:30:30.516 --> 01:30:31.572
Right away, admiral.

01:30:31.596 --> 01:30:32.772
Yeah, I was afraid you'd say that.

01:30:32.796 --> 01:30:34.752
Vice Admiral Holdo,

01:30:34.836 --> 01:30:36.633
I am relieving you
of your command

01:30:36.796 --> 01:30:40.072
for the survival of this ship,
its crew, and the Resistance.

01:30:40.956 --> 01:30:43.186
I hope you understand
what you're doing.

01:30:43.716 --> 01:30:44.716
Yeah.

01:30:44.956 --> 01:30:46.212
I'm going to the bridge.

01:30:46.236 --> 01:30:48.227
If they move, stun them.

01:31:08.156 --> 01:31:09.908
...at least three cycles so far.

01:31:10.076 --> 01:31:11.756
Yes, sir.
We are working on it.

01:31:18.796 --> 01:31:20.707
I will do my best, sir.

01:31:30.916 --> 01:31:32.110
Almost there.

01:31:41.276 --> 01:31:43.028
You don't have to do this.

01:31:43.596 --> 01:31:45.188
I feel the conflict in you.

01:31:45.356 --> 01:31:47.074
It's tearing you apart.

01:31:48.116 --> 01:31:50.471
Ben, when we touched hands,

01:31:50.636 --> 01:31:52.149
I saw your future.

01:31:52.356 --> 01:31:54.745
Just the shape of it,
but solid and clear.

01:31:55.316 --> 01:31:57.546
You will not bow before Snoke.

01:32:00.596 --> 01:32:02.154
You'll turn.

01:32:04.396 --> 01:32:06.034
I'll help you.

01:32:06.596 --> 01:32:08.109
I saw it.

01:32:08.276 --> 01:32:09.914
I saw something, too.

01:32:11.356 --> 01:32:12.356
Because of what I saw,

01:32:12.516 --> 01:32:14.950
I know when the moment comes,
you'll be the one to turn.

01:32:15.676 --> 01:32:17.473
You'll stand with me.

01:32:18.156 --> 01:32:19.156
Rey,

01:32:20.356 --> 01:32:22.665
I saw who your parents are.

01:32:37.556 --> 01:32:41.868
Well done, my good
and faithful apprentice.

01:32:42.036 --> 01:32:46.234
My faith in you is restored.

01:32:47.356 --> 01:32:49.586
Young Rey.

01:32:51.716 --> 01:32:53.274
Welcome.

01:32:58.636 --> 01:32:59.910
So this is it.

01:33:00.076 --> 01:33:01.953
The tracker's right behind this door.

01:33:15.156 --> 01:33:17.272
Haysian smelt.

01:33:17.716 --> 01:33:19.115
Best conductor.

01:33:27.716 --> 01:33:29.229
And you're welcome.

01:33:31.316 --> 01:33:33.212
Good time to figure out
how we get back to the fleet?

01:33:33.236 --> 01:33:34.908
I know where the nearest escape pods are.

01:33:34.996 --> 01:33:35.996
Course you do.

01:33:36.076 --> 01:33:37.873
BB-8, tell me something good.

01:33:39.756 --> 01:33:40.950
Poe, we're almost there.

01:33:41.116 --> 01:33:42.452
Have the cruiser prepped for lightspeed.

01:33:42.476 --> 01:33:44.706
Yeah, I'm on it, pal.
You just hurry.

01:33:46.916 --> 01:33:48.972
Clear the bridge, escort the
officers down to the hangar.

01:33:48.996 --> 01:33:50.509
Commander...
Captain Dameron,

01:33:50.596 --> 01:33:52.473
Admiral Holdo was looking for you.

01:33:52.636 --> 01:33:53.785
Yeah, we spoke.

01:33:55.236 --> 01:33:57.466
Sir, I am almost afraid to ask.

01:33:57.636 --> 01:33:59.467
Good instinct, Threepio.
Go with that.

01:34:12.236 --> 01:34:13.236
Seal that door!

01:34:16.036 --> 01:34:17.076
We're running out of time.

01:34:17.156 --> 01:34:18.384
Come on, how's it going?

01:34:18.556 --> 01:34:20.114
Almost there.

01:34:21.156 --> 01:34:22.987
Threepio, where do you think
you're going?

01:34:23.156 --> 01:34:25.147
It would be quite against
my programming

01:34:25.316 --> 01:34:27.034
- to be party to a mutiny.
- Hey!

01:34:27.196 --> 01:34:29.027
It is not correct protocol.

01:34:29.796 --> 01:34:32.310
Oh! Neither is this!

01:34:32.396 --> 01:34:34.352
Finn? We're ready to make the jump!

01:34:34.556 --> 01:34:35.784
Now or never.

01:34:39.356 --> 01:34:40.755
Now.

01:34:47.796 --> 01:34:48.796
You're up.

01:35:06.596 --> 01:35:08.852
- You there, hands up!
- Watch 'em, watch 'em.

01:35:08.876 --> 01:35:10.972
- Drop your weapons, now!
- Hands up, Rebel scum.

01:35:10.996 --> 01:35:12.668
Get down! I said, down!

01:35:22.436 --> 01:35:24.233
FN-2187.

01:35:26.116 --> 01:35:28.471
So good to have you back.

01:35:29.316 --> 01:35:30.431
They didn't make it.

01:35:44.356 --> 01:35:45.471
Leia.

01:35:56.956 --> 01:35:58.412
Please board the transports

01:35:58.436 --> 01:36:00.711
according to your
evacuation designation.

01:36:00.876 --> 01:36:01.932
All transports must be cleared...

01:36:01.956 --> 01:36:03.492
Okay,
help me push him up, guys.

01:36:03.516 --> 01:36:04.995
That one's a troublemaker.

01:36:05.636 --> 01:36:06.864
I like him.

01:36:07.596 --> 01:36:08.631
Me, too.

01:36:09.356 --> 01:36:11.347
Now, time to board your transport.

01:36:12.516 --> 01:36:14.154
For the transports to escape,

01:36:15.156 --> 01:36:18.114
someone needs to stay behind
and pilot the cruiser.

01:36:22.716 --> 01:36:24.274
Too many losses.

01:36:25.956 --> 01:36:28.072
I can't take any more.

01:36:28.436 --> 01:36:29.710
Sure you can.

01:36:31.116 --> 01:36:33.152
You taught me how.

01:36:35.596 --> 01:36:36.870
May the Force be...

01:36:38.916 --> 01:36:40.634
You go on.
I've said it enough.

01:36:42.396 --> 01:36:45.866
May the Force be with you always.

01:36:52.596 --> 01:36:53.932
Cloaking device activated.

01:36:53.956 --> 01:36:55.787
We should be off their scopes.

01:36:55.956 --> 01:36:58.345
Let's hope this works.

01:37:14.996 --> 01:37:17.271
Come closer, child.

01:37:20.076 --> 01:37:22.590
So much strength.

01:37:22.956 --> 01:37:26.028
Darkness rises,

01:37:26.236 --> 01:37:29.945
and light to meet it.

01:37:30.876 --> 01:37:34.789
I warned my young apprentice
that as he grew stronger,

01:37:35.116 --> 01:37:37.676
his equal in the light would rise.

01:37:40.276 --> 01:37:41.345
Skywalker...

01:37:41.436 --> 01:37:43.267
I assumed.

01:37:44.356 --> 01:37:45.356
Wrongly.

01:37:48.596 --> 01:37:50.393
Closer, I said.

01:37:57.196 --> 01:37:58.948
You underestimate Skywalker,

01:37:59.676 --> 01:38:00.791
and Ben Solo,

01:38:01.476 --> 01:38:02.750
and me.

01:38:03.356 --> 01:38:05.267
It will be your downfall.

01:38:05.396 --> 01:38:06.545
Oh...

01:38:06.916 --> 01:38:08.827
Have you seen something?

01:38:09.276 --> 01:38:12.234
A weakness in my apprentice.

01:38:12.396 --> 01:38:14.387
Is that why you came?

01:38:17.156 --> 01:38:18.828
Young fool.

01:38:19.036 --> 01:38:22.711
It was I who bridged your minds.

01:38:23.156 --> 01:38:26.512
I stoked Ren's conflicted soul.

01:38:26.676 --> 01:38:29.793
I knew he was not strong enough
to hide it from you.

01:38:29.956 --> 01:38:35.189
And you were not wise enough
to resist the bait.

01:38:38.756 --> 01:38:40.075
And now,

01:38:40.636 --> 01:38:45.471
you will give me Skywalker.

01:38:46.676 --> 01:38:49.110
Then I will kill you

01:38:49.316 --> 01:38:51.989
with the cruelest stroke.

01:38:52.836 --> 01:38:53.836
No.

01:38:54.476 --> 01:38:55.704
Yes.

01:38:59.756 --> 01:39:02.429
Give me

01:39:03.756 --> 01:39:05.474
everything.

01:39:06.036 --> 01:39:07.708
No! No!

01:39:08.196 --> 01:39:09.231
No!

01:39:16.316 --> 01:39:17.954
No. No.

01:39:18.116 --> 01:39:19.310
No, no, no!

01:39:24.236 --> 01:39:25.305
Poe.

01:39:31.036 --> 01:39:32.036
What is that?

01:39:32.196 --> 01:39:33.993
The mineral planet, Crait.

01:39:34.156 --> 01:39:36.511
An uncharted hideout from
the days of the Rebellion.

01:39:37.036 --> 01:39:38.913
- That's a Rebel base?
- Abandoned,

01:39:39.396 --> 01:39:40.396
but heavily armored

01:39:40.556 --> 01:39:41.556
with enough power

01:39:41.636 --> 01:39:43.012
to get a distress signal to our allies

01:39:43.036 --> 01:39:44.185
scattered in the Outer Rim.

01:39:44.356 --> 01:39:46.153
Holdo knew the First Order

01:39:46.316 --> 01:39:47.465
was tracking our big ship.

01:39:47.636 --> 01:39:50.469
They're not monitoring
for little transports.

01:39:50.996 --> 01:39:53.191
So we could slip down
to the surface unnoticed

01:39:53.356 --> 01:39:56.632
and hide till the First Order passes.

01:39:58.796 --> 01:39:59.865
That could work.

01:40:01.516 --> 01:40:03.472
She was more interested

01:40:03.596 --> 01:40:05.951
in protecting the light than she was

01:40:06.516 --> 01:40:08.984
seeming like a hero.

01:40:20.956 --> 01:40:22.230
Godspeed,

01:40:22.516 --> 01:40:23.949
Rebels.

01:40:53.676 --> 01:40:55.029
Well done, Phasma.

01:40:56.156 --> 01:40:58.909
Your ship and payment, as we agreed.

01:41:06.796 --> 01:41:08.388
You lying snake.

01:41:13.236 --> 01:41:15.511
We got caught,

01:41:16.196 --> 01:41:18.266
I cut a d-d-deal.

01:41:19.076 --> 01:41:20.111
Wait,

01:41:20.796 --> 01:41:22.115
cut a deal with what?

01:41:22.276 --> 01:41:24.236
Sir, we checked on the
information from the thief.

01:41:24.396 --> 01:41:26.830
We ran a decloaking scan,
and sure enough,

01:41:26.996 --> 01:41:29.396
30 Resistance transports
have just launched from the cruiser.

01:41:30.516 --> 01:41:32.666
He told us the truth.

01:41:33.476 --> 01:41:35.148
Will wonders never cease?

01:41:35.356 --> 01:41:36.356
No.

01:41:36.796 --> 01:41:37.796
Our weapons are ready?

01:41:37.956 --> 01:41:39.309
Ready and aimed, sir.

01:41:40.156 --> 01:41:41.794
Fire at will.

01:41:42.516 --> 01:41:44.029
Wait. No, no.
No, you can't!

01:41:44.596 --> 01:41:45.949
No!

01:42:00.116 --> 01:42:01.708
Admiral, we're taking fire!

01:42:01.876 --> 01:42:03.452
- Do we turn around?
- No, you're too far out.

01:42:03.476 --> 01:42:05.114
Full speed to planetfall.

01:42:05.276 --> 01:42:06.276
Full speed!

01:42:12.076 --> 01:42:14.112
Well, well,

01:42:14.196 --> 01:42:17.950
I did not expect Skywalker
to be so wise.

01:42:18.556 --> 01:42:21.116
We will give him and the Jedi Order

01:42:21.316 --> 01:42:23.671
the death he desires.

01:42:24.316 --> 01:42:25.544
After the Rebels are gone,

01:42:25.716 --> 01:42:27.195
we will go to his planet

01:42:27.356 --> 01:42:31.190
and obliterate the entire island.

01:42:37.996 --> 01:42:39.395
Such spunk.

01:42:40.076 --> 01:42:41.191
Look here now.

01:42:48.636 --> 01:42:53.664
The entire Resistance
on those transports...

01:42:54.316 --> 01:42:58.025
Soon they will all be gone.

01:42:58.396 --> 01:43:01.513
For you, all is lost.

01:43:05.556 --> 01:43:09.549
Ooh. And still that
fiery spit of hope.

01:43:11.196 --> 01:43:14.347
You have the spirit of a true Jedi!

01:43:22.836 --> 01:43:24.155
And because of that,

01:43:25.276 --> 01:43:26.675
you must die.

01:43:29.476 --> 01:43:31.626
My worthy apprentice,

01:43:31.796 --> 01:43:35.550
son of darkness,
heir apparent to Lord Vader.

01:43:35.716 --> 01:43:39.152
Where there was conflict,
I now sense resolve.

01:43:39.356 --> 01:43:42.029
Where there was weakness, strength.

01:43:42.836 --> 01:43:44.428
Complete your training,

01:43:44.756 --> 01:43:49.147
and fulfill your destiny.

01:43:58.396 --> 01:44:00.068
I know what I have to do.

01:44:02.116 --> 01:44:03.231
Ben.

01:44:04.916 --> 01:44:07.111
You think you can turn him?

01:44:07.676 --> 01:44:09.473
Pathetic child.

01:44:11.036 --> 01:44:13.425
I cannot be betrayed,

01:44:13.636 --> 01:44:15.672
I cannot be beaten.

01:44:15.836 --> 01:44:18.191
I see his mind,

01:44:18.356 --> 01:44:21.428
I see his every intent.

01:44:21.516 --> 01:44:22.516
Yes.

01:44:24.036 --> 01:44:29.713
I see him turning
the lightsaber to strike true.

01:44:30.276 --> 01:44:31.345
And now,

01:44:32.156 --> 01:44:34.033
foolish child,

01:44:34.196 --> 01:44:36.152
he ignites it,

01:44:36.796 --> 01:44:40.345
and kills his true enemy!

01:45:21.476 --> 01:45:23.196
Come on, give it full thrusters.
Full speed!

01:45:23.356 --> 01:45:24.755
I am, sir.

01:45:27.436 --> 01:45:28.949
You murdering bastard!

01:45:29.596 --> 01:45:31.746
T-T-Take it easy, Big F.

01:45:32.196 --> 01:45:35.029
They blow you up today,
you blow them up tomorrow.

01:45:35.756 --> 01:45:37.394
It's just business.

01:45:39.956 --> 01:45:41.150
You're wrong.

01:45:44.836 --> 01:45:45.871
Maybe.

01:47:29.356 --> 01:47:30.356
Ben!

01:47:42.636 --> 01:47:43.785
The fleet.

01:47:43.956 --> 01:47:44.996
Order them to stop firing.

01:47:45.116 --> 01:47:46.913
There's still time to save the fleet.

01:47:55.636 --> 01:47:56.705
Ben?

01:47:58.916 --> 01:48:00.872
It's time to let old things die.

01:48:03.436 --> 01:48:04.710
Snoke,

01:48:04.876 --> 01:48:06.150
Skywalker.

01:48:08.196 --> 01:48:09.549
The Sith,

01:48:10.236 --> 01:48:12.067
the Jedi, the Rebels...

01:48:12.236 --> 01:48:13.589
Let it all die.

01:48:14.236 --> 01:48:15.271
Rey.

01:48:17.316 --> 01:48:18.795
I want you to join me.

01:48:20.756 --> 01:48:23.316
We can rule together
and bring a new order to the galaxy.

01:48:23.476 --> 01:48:24.875
Don't do this, Ben.

01:48:26.036 --> 01:48:27.105
Please don't go this way.

01:48:27.276 --> 01:48:30.746
No, no. You're still
holding on! Let go!

01:48:31.916 --> 01:48:34.191
Do you wanna know the truth
about your parents?

01:48:35.196 --> 01:48:36.595
Or have you always known?

01:48:39.196 --> 01:48:40.754
And you've just hidden it away.

01:48:42.796 --> 01:48:44.309
You know the truth.

01:48:45.156 --> 01:48:46.589
Say it.

01:48:49.716 --> 01:48:50.944
Say it.

01:48:52.956 --> 01:48:54.469
They were nobody.

01:48:54.636 --> 01:48:56.274
They were filthy junk traders

01:48:56.436 --> 01:48:58.347
who sold you off for drinking money.

01:49:00.396 --> 01:49:03.513
They're dead in a paupers'
grave in the Jakku desert.

01:49:04.276 --> 01:49:06.232
You have no place in this story.

01:49:06.396 --> 01:49:08.387
You come from nothing.
You're nothing.

01:49:12.716 --> 01:49:13.990
But not to me.

01:49:18.076 --> 01:49:19.076
Join me.

01:49:32.556 --> 01:49:33.591
Please.

01:50:03.996 --> 01:50:04.996
Sir,

01:50:05.596 --> 01:50:08.349
the Resistance cruiser's
preparing to jump to lightspeed.

01:50:09.156 --> 01:50:10.225
It's empty.

01:50:10.396 --> 01:50:12.236
They're just trying
to pull our attention away.

01:50:12.676 --> 01:50:13.825
Pathetic.

01:50:14.036 --> 01:50:16.186
Keep your fire on the transports.

01:50:44.036 --> 01:50:46.755
Execution by blaster
is too good for them.

01:50:46.916 --> 01:50:48.952
Let's make this hurt.

01:50:54.676 --> 01:50:55.676
Finn.

01:51:00.316 --> 01:51:01.908
On my command.

01:51:06.716 --> 01:51:07.990
She's running away.

01:51:10.116 --> 01:51:11.265
No, she isn't.

01:51:25.196 --> 01:51:28.154
- No!
- Fire on that cruiser!

01:51:41.996 --> 01:51:42.996
Execute.

01:52:27.116 --> 01:52:28.185
Finn!

01:52:28.356 --> 01:52:31.234
There's a shuttle back that way!
We gotta go!

01:52:46.636 --> 01:52:48.069
Traitor!

01:52:49.756 --> 01:52:50.756
What?

01:53:14.076 --> 01:53:15.076
Finn!

01:53:34.476 --> 01:53:36.228
You are a bug in the system.

01:53:36.596 --> 01:53:37.790
Let's go, chrome dome.

01:53:45.476 --> 01:53:46.591
Come on!

01:53:56.276 --> 01:53:57.276
No!

01:54:03.236 --> 01:54:04.236
Hey.

01:54:20.196 --> 01:54:22.835
You were always scum.

01:54:24.396 --> 01:54:25.909
Rebel scum.

01:54:39.396 --> 01:54:41.626
Hey! Need a lift?

01:55:19.396 --> 01:55:21.512
What happened?

01:55:22.116 --> 01:55:23.788
The girl murdered Snoke.

01:55:28.236 --> 01:55:29.589
What happened?

01:55:29.756 --> 01:55:32.316
She took Snoke's escape craft.

01:55:32.716 --> 01:55:34.115
We know where she's going.

01:55:35.116 --> 01:55:36.996
Get all our forces down
to that Resistance base.

01:55:37.316 --> 01:55:38.749
Let's finish this.

01:55:39.556 --> 01:55:40.705
Finish this?

01:55:41.316 --> 01:55:43.386
Who do you think you're talking to?

01:55:43.836 --> 01:55:46.350
You presume to command my army?

01:55:47.116 --> 01:55:50.472
Our Supreme Leader is dead!
We have no ruler!

01:55:54.996 --> 01:55:58.306
The Supreme Leader is dead.

01:56:00.276 --> 01:56:03.393
Long live the Supreme Leader.

01:56:21.236 --> 01:56:23.386
They're coming, shut the door.

01:56:31.156 --> 01:56:32.828
Incoming!

01:56:36.436 --> 01:56:38.313
Go! Go! Move!

01:56:39.276 --> 01:56:41.232
Get that shield door down!

01:56:57.076 --> 01:56:58.452
No! Wait, don't shoot! It's us!

01:56:58.476 --> 01:56:59.511
No! Don't shoot!

01:56:59.676 --> 01:57:00.676
Hold your fire!

01:57:00.836 --> 01:57:02.872
- Don't shoot!
- Hold your fire!

01:57:05.436 --> 01:57:06.664
- Finn?
- Finn!

01:57:07.236 --> 01:57:08.874
Rose! You're not dead!

01:57:09.076 --> 01:57:10.270
Where's my droid?

01:57:11.556 --> 01:57:12.591
Buddy!

01:57:12.756 --> 01:57:15.270
I'm so glad to see you!

01:57:16.676 --> 01:57:18.826
Wait, what?
Wait, wait, wait, slow down.

01:57:18.996 --> 01:57:20.270
Is this all that's left?

01:57:30.636 --> 01:57:32.917
All right, shields are up
so they can't hit us from orbit.

01:57:33.156 --> 01:57:34.476
Use whatever power we've got left

01:57:34.556 --> 01:57:36.592
to broadcast a distress signal
to the Outer Rim.

01:57:36.756 --> 01:57:38.428
Use my personal code.

01:57:38.916 --> 01:57:41.749
If there are any allies to the Resistance,

01:57:42.316 --> 01:57:43.431
it's now or never.

01:57:44.156 --> 01:57:46.067
Rose, what do you got?

01:57:46.556 --> 01:57:50.151
Rotting munitions, rusted artillery,
some half-gutted skim speeders.

01:57:50.316 --> 01:57:51.316
Well,

01:57:52.316 --> 01:57:53.749
let's just pray that big-ass door

01:57:53.876 --> 01:57:56.151
holds long enough for us
to get help.

01:58:06.436 --> 01:58:08.233
A battering ram cannon.

01:58:08.396 --> 01:58:10.034
A what now?

01:58:10.476 --> 01:58:11.875
Miniaturized Death Star tech.

01:58:12.036 --> 01:58:13.788
It'll crack that door open like an egg.

01:58:14.556 --> 01:58:16.356
There has to be a back way
out of here, right?

01:58:17.516 --> 01:58:19.313
BB-8, what do you got?

01:58:20.116 --> 01:58:23.313
BB-8 has analyzed
the mine's schematics.

01:58:23.476 --> 01:58:26.593
This is the only way in or out.

01:58:33.956 --> 01:58:34.956
Come on.

01:58:35.956 --> 01:58:37.184
We have allies.

01:58:37.436 --> 01:58:39.267
People believe in Leia.

01:58:39.956 --> 01:58:41.514
They'll get our message, they'll come.

01:58:42.076 --> 01:58:44.306
But we have to buy time.

01:58:45.276 --> 01:58:47.949
We gotta take out that cannon.

01:58:52.236 --> 01:58:53.236
On me! On me!

01:58:54.436 --> 01:58:55.436
Move! Move!

01:58:55.756 --> 01:58:57.109
Go back! Gather your weapons!

01:58:57.276 --> 01:58:58.709
Get over here!

01:58:58.876 --> 01:58:59.916
Hold your fire!

01:59:17.156 --> 01:59:18.156
Salt.

01:59:18.316 --> 01:59:19.716
Ground forces, incoming.

01:59:19.756 --> 01:59:21.428
Copy that. On our way.

01:59:38.836 --> 01:59:39.985
Engage your mono-ski.

01:59:40.156 --> 01:59:41.714
The green toggle.

01:59:51.756 --> 01:59:52.905
All right, listen up.

01:59:53.116 --> 01:59:56.233
I don't like these rust buckets
and I don't like our odds, but...

01:59:56.716 --> 01:59:58.035
What the hell?

01:59:58.196 --> 01:59:59.470
Just keep it tight

01:59:59.636 --> 02:00:02.594
and don't get drawn in too close
till they roll that cannon out front.

02:00:22.476 --> 02:00:24.706
All right, ground forces,
lay down some fire!

02:00:37.756 --> 02:00:39.633
Thirteen incoming light craft.

02:00:39.796 --> 02:00:41.707
Shall we hold until we clear them?

02:00:41.916 --> 02:00:44.794
No. The Resistance
is in that mine.

02:00:45.316 --> 02:00:46.465
Push through.

02:00:51.316 --> 02:00:52.829
Fighters, break off!

02:01:02.916 --> 02:01:05.794
Come on! We gotta hold them
till they pull up that cannon!

02:01:21.236 --> 02:01:23.272
Rose, you got three right behind you!

02:01:31.156 --> 02:01:32.156
I can't lose 'em!

02:01:39.276 --> 02:01:40.948
Whoo! Yeah!

02:01:53.996 --> 02:01:55.952
Whoo! I like this!

02:02:04.556 --> 02:02:07.628
Blow that piece of junk out of the sky!

02:02:07.836 --> 02:02:09.189
All fighters!

02:02:16.356 --> 02:02:18.028
Chewie, peel off from the battle.

02:02:18.196 --> 02:02:19.549
Draw them away from the speeders.

02:02:25.356 --> 02:02:26.994
She drew 'em off! All of 'em!

02:02:27.156 --> 02:02:28.748
Oh, they hate that ship!

02:02:41.356 --> 02:02:42.356
Chewie!

02:03:13.716 --> 02:03:14.716
There it is!

02:03:19.916 --> 02:03:21.031
That is a big gun.

02:03:21.196 --> 02:03:22.516
Okay, it's heavily armored.

02:03:22.636 --> 02:03:24.627
Our only shot is right down the throat.

02:03:32.436 --> 02:03:34.188
The cannon's opening.
This is our chance.

02:03:34.356 --> 02:03:35.636
All firepower on those speeders.

02:03:35.716 --> 02:03:38.150
Concentrate all fire on the speeders!

02:03:45.036 --> 02:03:46.469
We're taking heavy losses.

02:03:58.876 --> 02:04:00.892
They're picking us all off.
We're not gonna make it.

02:04:00.916 --> 02:04:02.634
All right,
making my final approach.

02:04:02.796 --> 02:04:04.195
Target in sight, guns are hot.

02:04:04.356 --> 02:04:05.584
No! Pull off!

02:04:05.756 --> 02:04:06.791
What?

02:04:06.996 --> 02:04:08.532
The cannon is charged!
It's a suicide run!

02:04:08.556 --> 02:04:09.909
All craft, pull away!

02:04:10.076 --> 02:04:12.146
- No! I'm almost there!
- Retreat, Finn!

02:04:12.316 --> 02:04:13.544
That's an order!

02:04:22.556 --> 02:04:24.706
Finn? It's too late! Don't do this!

02:04:24.876 --> 02:04:26.867
No! I won't let them win!

02:04:28.916 --> 02:04:30.872
No! Finn, listen to Poe!

02:04:31.036 --> 02:04:32.469
We have to retreat!

02:04:44.516 --> 02:04:46.950
The cannon is warming up now.

02:04:47.116 --> 02:04:48.452
Copy that. We see it.

02:04:48.476 --> 02:04:50.228
Preparing to fire.

02:05:32.036 --> 02:05:33.867
Move! Go, go! Quick!

02:05:34.036 --> 02:05:35.708
Let's go, let's go!

02:05:42.116 --> 02:05:43.310
Rose?

02:05:48.956 --> 02:05:50.071
Rose?

02:05:50.476 --> 02:05:51.875
Rose?

02:05:52.796 --> 02:05:54.627
Why would you do that? Huh?

02:05:54.716 --> 02:05:56.593
I was almost there.

02:05:57.396 --> 02:05:58.875
Why would you stop me?

02:05:59.636 --> 02:06:01.752
I saved you,

02:06:02.796 --> 02:06:03.796
dummy.

02:06:04.916 --> 02:06:06.588
That's how we're gonna win.

02:06:06.756 --> 02:06:09.145
Not fighting what we hate,

02:06:09.596 --> 02:06:11.951
saving what we love.

02:06:31.396 --> 02:06:32.749
General Hux,

02:06:32.916 --> 02:06:34.474
advance.

02:06:34.916 --> 02:06:36.508
No quarter.

02:06:37.916 --> 02:06:39.474
No prisoners.

02:06:41.236 --> 02:06:44.467
Our distress signal's been
received at multiple points,

02:06:44.636 --> 02:06:46.706
but no response.

02:06:47.276 --> 02:06:49.028
They've heard us,

02:06:49.396 --> 02:06:51.512
but no one's coming.

02:06:55.876 --> 02:06:58.026
We fought till the end.

02:07:00.356 --> 02:07:05.305
But the galaxy has lost all its hope.

02:07:06.676 --> 02:07:08.109
The spark

02:07:10.036 --> 02:07:11.515
is out.

02:07:37.116 --> 02:07:38.674
Luke.

02:07:47.116 --> 02:07:49.710
I know what you're gonna say.

02:07:50.916 --> 02:07:52.747
I changed my hair.

02:07:54.756 --> 02:07:56.428
It's nice that way.

02:07:58.276 --> 02:07:59.914
Leia,

02:08:01.076 --> 02:08:02.076
I'm sorry.

02:08:02.276 --> 02:08:04.107
I know.

02:08:04.316 --> 02:08:06.511
I know you are.

02:08:07.316 --> 02:08:09.272
I'm just glad you're here

02:08:10.196 --> 02:08:11.754
at the end.

02:08:13.156 --> 02:08:14.987
I came to face him, Leia.

02:08:16.996 --> 02:08:19.226
And I can't save him.

02:08:19.596 --> 02:08:22.872
I held out hope for so long,

02:08:25.636 --> 02:08:28.196
but I know my son is gone.

02:08:29.076 --> 02:08:31.795
No one's ever really gone.

02:09:07.396 --> 02:09:09.227
Master Luke.

02:09:32.276 --> 02:09:33.276
Stop!

02:09:58.916 --> 02:10:02.431
I want every gun we have
to fire on that man.

02:10:07.596 --> 02:10:09.075
Do it.

02:10:25.716 --> 02:10:26.831
More!

02:10:30.116 --> 02:10:31.116
More!

02:10:45.676 --> 02:10:47.314
That's enough.

02:10:48.756 --> 02:10:50.951
That's enough!

02:10:56.876 --> 02:10:58.514
Do you think you got him?

02:10:59.836 --> 02:11:01.667
Now, if we're ready to get moving,

02:11:01.836 --> 02:11:04.031
we can finish this.

02:11:04.196 --> 02:11:05.311
Sir?

02:11:31.796 --> 02:11:33.115
Bring me down to him.

02:11:33.476 --> 02:11:36.309
Keep the door covered
and don't advance until I say.

02:11:36.396 --> 02:11:37.396
Supreme Leader,

02:11:37.836 --> 02:11:39.349
don't get distracted, our goal...

02:11:41.836 --> 02:11:43.064
Right away, sir.

02:11:44.196 --> 02:11:45.709
Med pack!

02:11:45.916 --> 02:11:47.952
I need a med pack!

02:11:48.156 --> 02:11:50.192
She's hurt pretty bad.

02:12:08.956 --> 02:12:10.230
It's Kylo Ren.

02:12:10.436 --> 02:12:11.630
Luke's facing him alone.

02:12:11.796 --> 02:12:13.196
Well, we should help him.
Let's go.

02:12:13.356 --> 02:12:15.028
No, wait. Wait.

02:12:28.996 --> 02:12:31.351
Did you come back to say you forgive me?

02:12:32.356 --> 02:12:34.233
To save my soul?

02:12:35.996 --> 02:12:37.588
No.

02:12:56.476 --> 02:12:58.706
He's doing this for a reason.

02:13:00.556 --> 02:13:02.308
He's stalling so we can escape.

02:13:02.396 --> 02:13:03.396
Escape?

02:13:03.476 --> 02:13:04.612
He's one man against an army.

02:13:04.636 --> 02:13:06.149
We have to help him,
we have to fight.

02:13:06.316 --> 02:13:08.511
No, no. We are the spark
that'll light the fire

02:13:08.596 --> 02:13:10.188
that'll burn the First Order down.

02:13:11.316 --> 02:13:14.388
Skywalker's doing this
so we can survive.

02:13:14.556 --> 02:13:16.092
There's gotta be a way
out of this mine.

02:13:16.116 --> 02:13:17.276
Hell, how did he get in here?

02:13:17.436 --> 02:13:21.475
Sir, it is possible that
a natural unmapped opening exists.

02:13:21.676 --> 02:13:24.634
But this facility is such
a maze of endless tunnels

02:13:24.796 --> 02:13:26.514
that the odds of finding an exit

02:13:26.596 --> 02:13:29.269
- are 15,428...
- Shh. Shush. Hush. Shush up.

02:13:29.356 --> 02:13:30.914
Shut up!

02:13:32.116 --> 02:13:33.834
- To one.
- Listen.

02:13:36.516 --> 02:13:38.746
My audio sensors
no longer detect the...

02:13:38.916 --> 02:13:39.985
Exactly.

02:13:45.876 --> 02:13:48.595
Where'd the crystal critters go?

02:13:54.276 --> 02:13:55.276
Follow me.

02:13:59.836 --> 02:14:01.792
What are you looking at me for?

02:14:01.956 --> 02:14:03.435
Follow him.

02:14:15.076 --> 02:14:17.544
If the beacon's right beneath us,
they've got to be somewhere.

02:14:17.716 --> 02:14:19.229
Keep scanning for life forms.

02:14:29.036 --> 02:14:30.549
This way.

02:14:35.116 --> 02:14:36.754
I see them! Chewie, there!

02:14:50.436 --> 02:14:53.314
No. No, no, no.

02:14:56.716 --> 02:14:57.716
No!

02:15:09.956 --> 02:15:11.787
Lifting rocks.

02:15:51.876 --> 02:15:54.390
I failed you, Ben.

02:15:55.236 --> 02:15:57.591
- I'm sorry.
- I'm sure you are!

02:15:58.756 --> 02:16:00.826
The Resistance is dead.

02:16:00.996 --> 02:16:02.554
The war is over.

02:16:02.756 --> 02:16:04.747
And when I kill you,

02:16:04.916 --> 02:16:07.350
I will have killed the last Jedi.

02:16:07.516 --> 02:16:08.631
Amazing.

02:16:09.196 --> 02:16:12.950
Every word of what you just said
was wrong.

02:16:15.316 --> 02:16:18.433
The Rebellion is reborn today.

02:16:20.636 --> 02:16:22.627
The war

02:16:22.796 --> 02:16:24.468
is just beginning.

02:16:25.676 --> 02:16:29.555
And I will not be the last Jedi.

02:17:09.356 --> 02:17:11.392
I'll destroy her,

02:17:11.556 --> 02:17:13.592
and you,

02:17:13.756 --> 02:17:15.394
and all of it.

02:17:19.236 --> 02:17:20.236
No.

02:17:21.356 --> 02:17:24.587
Strike me down in anger
and I'll always be with you.

02:17:27.236 --> 02:17:29.306
Just like your father.

02:18:18.756 --> 02:18:19.756
No.

02:18:24.076 --> 02:18:26.192
See you around, kid.

02:18:39.876 --> 02:18:41.275
No!

02:21:18.716 --> 02:21:20.752
C'ai!

02:21:20.836 --> 02:21:22.792
Such a friend.

02:21:23.156 --> 02:21:24.874
Chewie!

02:21:26.196 --> 02:21:27.948
It looks good.

02:21:28.396 --> 02:21:29.545
That was crazy, man.

02:21:30.996 --> 02:21:32.475
- Hi.
- Hi.

02:21:33.076 --> 02:21:34.111
I'm Poe.

02:21:34.956 --> 02:21:35.956
Rey.

02:21:36.316 --> 02:21:37.351
I know.

02:21:49.676 --> 02:21:51.732
When we get to the Outer Rim,
I have a contact there.

02:21:51.756 --> 02:21:53.076
Quite definitely possible.

02:22:03.476 --> 02:22:04.955
Luke is gone.

02:22:05.836 --> 02:22:07.235
I felt it.

02:22:07.836 --> 02:22:09.667
But it wasn't sadness or pain.

02:22:10.956 --> 02:22:13.265
It was peace and purpose.

02:22:14.236 --> 02:22:15.555
I felt it, too.

02:22:18.236 --> 02:22:21.148
How do we build a Rebellion from this?

02:22:25.596 --> 02:22:28.315
We have everything we need.

02:22:47.956 --> 02:22:49.753
Luke Skywalker,

02:22:49.916 --> 02:22:51.713
Jedi Master.

02:22:53.743 --> 02:23:07.743
Psagmeno.com
Quality Movies Subs and Info
